<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Wahannisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Wahannisa Xaafide Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggele</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wahannisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waha.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wahannisa Xaafide</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggele</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Wahannisa Yesuusa, «As maaqqii as gidda benttide Xoozze Qaala» yaga7i qonccizane. Hyay Wonggelize xaafinttidanna, eza nabbabize asuntsi Yesuusa asi ashshizaya maaqqii ye7oda ga7inttide Xoozze Na7a maaqqidanno ammanode gaaran E gidda ammanzutsis medhina de7o yezanno un erode gaar (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wonggelizes tiino kifilize medhinabaz maaqqide Xoozze qaalan Yesuusa fetto maaqqidanno ohi maaqqii, Yesuusa ashshizaya maaqqii ye7oda ga7eze Xoozze Na7a maaqqidanno beezze melle melle kille baz beezida. Xaafize, Yesuus Kiristtoosa fa ommite turii Xoozze Na7an Xoozze adera fetto maaqqizanno (1:1) afa beezida. Yesuusa fa ommite ta Abrahameppa tiino yene (8:58) yagayda. Faaditsite Toomaasa, «Ta Laatstsayo, ta Xoozayo» yaga7i xeegida (20:28). Yennippa kaallii mahi hyanna kille bazappa benttide aafe qofa ohize taarikita kaallane. Hyay kifilize fettii fettii asuntsi Yesuusa ammani eza kaallizuntsana maaqqidanno ohine; mahi melluntsi eera wayzi ixinttezakon wayzi ammananxii ixxezako ohine. Zofane 13-17 yellodes Yesuusa aykkinttide ugure ees, E tamaaruntsara akko gaar mintsi yellintte yezako, mahi wonttisti wode suxunttodannippa tiino giigintte qaalaran mintsitsize qaala unttis ohidanno qonccizane. Hyal7e zofanuntsi Yesuusa aykkinttide bazin firddas shiiqidanno, E suxintton E denddito, yinnii gaara denddoppa suuba fa tamaaruntsis E qonccide qonccitsiti baz ohine.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqize Wahannisan Yesuusa tiino tamaaruntsana <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa qoncce oocha aykkidanno <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssutsi qammito Yerusalaame kale <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Laatstse dendditon qonccitsiton <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xaatsi qofa: Galila mahi fa tamaaruntsis benttidanno <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Qaala tiino yene. Qaalizen Xoozara yene; ye Qaalize Xoozii. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Ezin tiinoppan Xoozara yene. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Xoozze ubbabazito Qaala baggara medhdhida. Medhinttide bazappa fettibazin E baytsi medhinttide bazi baaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>E gidda de7o yene; yinna de7itan asis foo7o. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Foo7ize dhuma gidda foo7ane; dhumita foo7iza gamikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Xoozapp kiitinttide, Wahannisa ga7inttize fettii asi yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Maato. 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luqa. 3:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Asi ubba foo7iza ammanode fana E foo7ize markka maaqqii yi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>E foo7ize baz markkidhodes yi7idap attin fa ommite foo7o baaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Asi ubbas foo7ize turii foo7o alame ye7ine.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Qaalize alame yene. Xoozze Qaalara alamito medhdhida, yezin alamita eza erikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>E fa bagguntsago yi7ida, yezin E bagguntsin eza ekkikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Yezin E fana ekkiduntsisin E suntsite ammaniduntsis unttis Xoozze na7a maaqqade gaar adetits wolqqa inggida. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Un Xoozappa yelinttidap attin asi yelinttize wogara woy dhiiratsi qofappa woy as qofappa yelinttikaaya. Xoozze E unttis ade.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Qaala asho maaqqida; aadho keehatitsaran turetitsara kumii nu gidda aqida. Fettii na7ays E aday kale yeze bonchchiti fana yeze bonchcho nu bi7ida.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Wahannisa E baz markkidhida. Fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Taanii, ‹Taappa suubara ye7ize taappa tiino yeze gisho taappa aadhane› ga7i markkidhidanna hyanno» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Nu ubbuntsi E aadho keehatitsite kumutsitippa anjjolla afa anjjo ekkida. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Xoozze higge Muse baggara inggida, yezin aadho keehatitsin turetitsi Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara yi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Xoozza bi7ide asi ooden baaya; fa Aday kale yeze fettii Na7ay Xooz maaqqide E qonccizida.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqize Wahannisa markkatitsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Maato. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-8">Luqa. 3:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Yerusalaame yeze hyalaquntsi, kahinuntsin Leewuntsin, «Ne oode?» ga7i, Wahannisa oocode gaar eego kiittin, Wahannisa unttis markkidhide markkatitsita hyanno.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Wahannisa, «Ta Kiristtoosa baaya» yaga7i, loytsii markkidhidap attin kaddikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Un, «Yeezin, ne oode? Neenii Eliyaasane?» ga7i oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15-18">Mahe 18:15-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wahannisa, «Ade tana baaya» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Mahi un, «Neenii ye7odes ga7intteze nabene?» ga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wahannisa, «Ade» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Yeezin, «Ne oode? Nu nuna kiittezuntsis ohode fana neenii nena oona ga7e?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Wahannisa mahi, Nabe Isayaasa ga7idanni gaara, « ‹Laatstse ogito luulizote!› ga7i akko baayze ganasa uukkize atstse qaalize tana» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsi kiittide asuntsi <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Wahannisago, «Neenii Kiristtoosa woy Eeliyaasa woy nabe maaqqaanxi ixxiko, yeezin akkos xammaqe?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Wahannisa mahi, «Taanii hyaatsara xammaqane, yezin yin eroosse asi yin gidda eqqida. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>E taappa suubite ye7ine. Ta melle atto yezin Ees caamma gaadiza billodes beezoos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Yinna ubba Yorddaanosa borkkappa seko fintsa, Bitaaniya katamite, Wahannisa xammaqize besite hyanida.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze Duro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Wahannisa wonttisti wode Yesuusa faago ye7odera bi7i, «Alame nagara uccize Xoozze Durzay hyaychche! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Taanii, ‹Taappa suubara fettii asi ye7oda. E taappa tiino yeze gisho taappa aadhane› ga7i ohide hyaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>E oode yezako ta eroos. Yezin Isra7eele asuntsis eza qonccissades hyaatsara xammaqittera yi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Wahannisa hyannigaara ga7i markkidhida: «Geeshi Ayyaana saloppa wolle gaar wodhdhizin bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Yinna hyanodannippa tiino taanii eza eroos. Yezin hyaatsara xammaqodes tana kiittide Xoozze, ‹Geeshi Ayyaana wodhdhii eera yessadera neenii be7ize Geeshi Ayyaanara xammaqoday eza› yaga7i taas ohida. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Taanii yinna hyanodera bi7i, E Xoozze Na7a maaqqidanno markkidhane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kaallide tiino tamaaruntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Mahi wonttisti wode Wahannisa fa tamaaruntsappa lam77untsara wolla eqqida. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yesuusa aadhodera Wahannisa bi7i, «Xoozze durize hyaynishe!» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Lam77i Wahannisa tamaaruntsi Wahannisa gaazanno si7i Yesuusa kaallida. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesuusa fana kaallizuntsana suub maaqqii bi7i, «Akko koye?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Un mahi, «Rebbii, ne aba yene?» yagayda. (Bilitsita Asttamaarizayo ga7e.)<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Hyankka yi7i bo7ote» yagayda. Un hyanggi E yezebezito bi7ida. Ye wode sa7ita taphphi saate gaar maaqqide gisho E kale feezhida.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Wahannisa gaydanno si7i, Yesuusa kaallide lam77i tamaaruntsappa fete, Simoon Phexiroosa ishe Inddiriyase. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Inddiriyase tiino fa ishe Simoonara yellintti, «Nuunii Mesiihi denggida» yagayda. (Bilitsitan Kiristtoosa ga7e.) <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Inddiriyase Simoona Yesuusago ki7ida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesuusa Simoona bi7i, «Ne Yoona na7a Simoona; ne suntsita Keefa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Keefa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaaze qaalize Aramayke doona maaqqii, Girike doonara bilitsita Phexiroosa woy lalla ga7inttane.</char></note> ga7i xeeginttoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Filphoosan Natina7eelen xeegida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Wonttisti wode Yesuusa Galila qitodes qofa accida. E Filphoosa denggi, «Tana kaallo!» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filphoosa, Inddiraseran Phexiroosaran yezide Beetesayda katama asi.<verse eid="JHN 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filphoosa Natina7eela yellii, «Muse higge maxaafite, mahi nabuntsin E baz xaafide Yoosefa na7a Naazirete Yesuusa nu denggida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natina7eela mahi, «Naazirete katamappa lo77o baz kessades dandda7ane?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filphoosa, «Yi7i bo7o» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Natina7eela faago ye7izaya Yesuusa bi7i, «Gene baayze turii Isra7eele asi hyaynishe!» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natina7eela Yesuusago, «Ne tana aba ere?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesuusa mahi, «Filphoosa nena xeegodannippa tiino, ne belese minxa oomo yezin ta nena bi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natina7eela mahi, «Asttamaarizayo, ne Xoozze Na7a! Ne Isra7eele kaati!» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesuusa eego, «Ta nena belese minxa oomo bi7ida gayde gisho ammanane? Ne hyannippa aadhizebaz be7ada!» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Mahi Yesuusa, «Taanii yinttis turibaz ohine; salo bugunttin, Xoozze kiitanchchuntsi As Na7alla afa kessaderan keddoderan yin be7ada» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Medho 28:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa zhagana bessa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Hyaydzintsa wode Galila Qaana katama zhagana yene. Yesuusa intta yinna zhagantte yeshsha. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesuusan E tamaaruntsin wolla yinna zhagantte xeeginttida. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Woyne ushita hyal7in, Yesuusa intta Yesuusago, «Unttis woyne ushita hyal7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Immo, ne hyanne gelippe? Ta wodita hyaga yelikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Yesuusa intta oochchizuntsago, «E yinttis ohizanno ubba oochchote» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Ayhudunts fa geeshe wogas maadinttize izippun shuchchi ganuntsi yinna besite yene. Fete fete gaanuntsi lam77i woy hyaydzdzii xugga aykkane. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesuusa kiitinttizuntsago, «Gaantte hyaatsi kuntsote» yagayda. Un gaanuntsis doontto yellodes hyaatsi kuntsida. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Hyatte duuqqii zhagantto adidhii folizes inggote» yagayda. Un ees kanggi inggida.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Zhagantto adidhii folizay woyne ushita laaminttide hyaatsito qamasi bi7i anappa ye7ezakon erikaaya, yezin hyaatsito kuntside kiitinttizuntsi erane. Zhagantto adidhii folizay machcho ekkizaya xeegii, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>«Ooden lo77o woyne ushito asi tiinidhii ushshane. Yeyzi asuntsi uzhii mizhidannippa suuba zhagginttida inggane. Yezin neenii lo77o woyne ushito hyanno yellodes gaddii gam7izida» gayda.<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesuusa hyay tiino kille oochchiza Galila Qaana katama oochchida; ize fa bonchchito beezida. E tamaaruntsin eza ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Yesuusa fa inttira, fa ishuntsaran fa tamaaruntsara wolla Qifirnahoome katama hyanggi eeratsi qamma gam7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Maato. 4:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xoozze Keetstsappa zal7izuntsana kessida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Maato. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar. 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luqa. 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Ayhudunts bonchchize Faasiga Ba7ale qammita ukkin Yesuusa Yerusalaame qitida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Keze 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Hyanggi Xoozze Keetstsa bora, hyaari, duron wollen baayzuntsanan fa oyditilla bettii bira laammizuntsana bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>E xurqqaafa giigizii asuntsana ubba unttana un hyaaruntsara Xoozze keetstsappa bay7i bale kessida. Bira laammizuntsana xarpheziton shirii olii un birto lalida. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Wolle bayzizuntsana, «Hyantsi wolluntsana hyannippa kessote; ta Aday keetsito gabe mahippete» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>E tamaaruntsi Geeshi Maxaafite, «Ta ne keetsitis yiqsinttize yiqsintta tana tama gaara michchane» ga7intti xaafinttidanno tiirida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maz. 69:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Yinnippa suuba, Ayhuduntsi mahi, «Ne hyanno oochchodes nees wolqqa yezannis nuna akko malla oochchii beessade?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesuusa, «Hyanna Xoozze keetsito wul7ote ta hyaydzdzii qammara mahi keexxoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Maato. 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar. 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Yinnii gisho Ayhuduntsi, «Hyanna Xoozze Keetsito keexxodes oyttam izippun bere ekkida, yezin neenii hyaydzdzii qammara keexxoda?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Yezin Yesuusa ohize Xoozze Keetsita fa ashtibaz. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa hyayqoppa denddidannippa suuba eza tamaaruntsi E yinno gaydanno tiirida. Mahi un Geeshi maxaafite xaafinttidannon Yesuusa ohidanno ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yesuusa Faasiga bonchchize bessa Yerusalaame yessadera, E oochchide kille bazito bi7i gaama asuntsi eza ammanida. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Yezin Yesuusa asuntsana ubba erize gisho unttana ammanikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>As wozintte yeze baz E fa ommite erize gisho asi baz ooden ees ohode gaar koshshikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Niqodimoosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Farisaawunts baggappa maaqqide, Ayhudunts hyalaqa, Niqodimoosa ga7inttize fettii asi yene. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Ezin qamma Yesuusago yi7i, «Bonchcho Asttamaarizayo, neenii Xoozii kiittide asttamaare maaqqizanno nuunii erane. Akkos gayko, Xoozii eera yezanxiko hyanno neenii oochchize kille bazito oochchodes dandda7ize asi baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii nees turo turo gaane; ooden lam7intsa yelinttanxiko Xoozze ka7itumo be7ades dandda7oos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Niqodimoosa, «Cinggii asi wayzi lam7intsa yelinttodes dandda7e? Fa inttii saza maaqqii gelii mahi yelinttodes dandda7e?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii nees turo turo gaane; asi hyaatsappan Geeshi Ayyaanappa yelinttanxiko, Xoozze ka7itumo gelodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Asho na7atitsi adeppan inddippan yelinttane; Xoozze na7atitsi Geeshi Ayyaanappa yelinttane. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Taanii, ‹Yin lam7intsa yelinttodes beezane› ga7i yinttis ohide gisho neenii gaama qoipippe. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Baqo fa koyze zala baqqane. Ne E ootsito si7izanno fattin E abappa ye7izako woy aba qitizako ne eroos. Ayyaanappa yelinttide ubba yinnii fana» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Yeezin Niqodimoosa, «Yinna wayzi hyanodes dandda7e?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Neenii Isra7eeluntsi asttamaare maaqqitera hyanno erosa? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Taanii nees turo turo gaane; nu erizebaz ohinen bi7idebaz markkidhane, yezin nu markkatitsito yin ekkoos. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Taanii yinttis sa7abaz ohin yin ammanoosuntsi salobaz ohin wayzi ammanode? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Saloppa wodhdhide As Na7ayip attin salo kezide ooden baaya; [salo yeze As Na7ay tana]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Salo yeze As Na7ay tana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii zaga maxaafuntsi gujjane. </char></note> yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14-15"/>Muse akko baayze ganas sa7a shooshi suxxidannifana tana ammanze ubbuntsi medhina de7o ekkode fanan dhabaame fana As Na7ay suxunttodes beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Faydo 21:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Eza ammanze ubbuntsi medhina de7o laattodep attin dhabaame gaar Xoozii hyanna alamito loytsii kadhide gisho fa fettii Na7aya inggida. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Xoozii fa Na7aya hyanna alamite kiittidanna alamito firddodes maaqqikaayzin alamito E baggara ashshodes.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Na7aya ammanze ooden firddinttoos, yezin Na7aya ammanoose ooden fettii Xoozze Na7aya ammanikaayze gisho hyatte firddinttida. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Firdditan hyanno: foo7o alame yi7ida, yezin asunts oochita iita maaqqide gisho asuntsi foo7itippa aatsii dhuma kadhane. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Iita baz oochchize ooden foo7o ixxane. Akkos gayko, fa oochita qonccaame fana foo7ogo ye7oos. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Yezin turtto oochchize ooden Xoozze kiittidanni fana E oochchidanno foo7o qonccissade fana foo7ogo ye7ine.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Xammaqize Wahannisan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusan E tamaaruntsin Yihuda sa7a qitida. Yesuusa yeyga xammaqittera unttara eerats wode bettida.<verse eid="JHN 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Mahi Wahannisa Saleeme kale yeze Henoona gaaze bessa gaama hyaatsi yeze gisho asuntsana yeyga xammaqane. Asuntsin yeyga hyanggi xammaqinttane. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Ye wode Wahannisa hyaga acinttikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Maato. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar. 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luqa. 3:19-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Yinnippa suuba, Wahannisa tamaaruntsin fettii Ayhude atstsay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Fettii Ayhude Atstsay: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii maxaafuntsi «Eerats Ayhude asuntsi» yagaane. </char></note> geeshe wogabaz wolla lallida. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Un Wahannisago hyanggi, «Asttamaarizayo, Yorddaanosa borkkappa seko fintsa neera yeze, neenii E baz markkidhiday, hyaychche xammaqane. Asunts ubba eego hyanggane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Wahannisa mahi, «Xoozii inggikaayze asi akko bazin ekkodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>‹Taanii Kiristtoosa baaya, yezin eeppa tiino kiitinttida› gaydannis yin, yin ommite taas markka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Waha. 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Gelodes giiginttdanna ekkodes giigezes. Ekkizes lagguntsi E kale eqqii E gaazanno si7ize wode gaama ufayttane. Yinnii gisho, hyanna ta ufayssita folinttida. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>E dammodes ta eerodes beezane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Afappa yi7ize ubbappa dhoqqa. Sa7appa benttide sa7a asi; E sa7abaz ohine. Saloppa yi7ide ubbappa aatsii. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>E fa bi7idebazin si7idebaz izo markkidhane, yiikon E markkatitsito si7ize baaya. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>E markkatitsito ekkize ooden Xoozze turo maaqqidanno tillizane. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Xoozii fa Geeshi Ayyaana ees kuntsi inggize gisho Xoozii kiittide Xoozze qaala ohine. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Aday fa Na7aya kadhii ubbabazito E kushite gaddida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Maato. 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luqa. 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Na7aya ammanzes medhina de7o yene. Yezin Na7aya ammanoosella Xoozze firdda yenep attin E de7o denggoos.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Samaara maachiton</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Yesuusa Wahannisappa aatsii kaallizuntsana faago shiishii xammaqizanno Farisaawuntsi si7ida. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Maaqqikon Yesuusa tamaaruntsi xammaqidap attin Yesuusa oonan xammaqikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesuusa asuntsi E baz gaazanno si7ide wode Yihudappa denddii maaqqii Galila qitida. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Galila qititera Samaarera aadhodanna ees attaamebaz maaqqida.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Yinnii gisho, Yayqooba fa na7ay Yoosefas inggide gaditii kale yeze Sikaare gaaze Samaara katama yi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Medho 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Yinna besite Yayqoobas hyaatsi doochii yene. Yesuusa hyanggitera labbii yinna hyaatsi doochiti kale bettida. Ye wode sa7ita awarappa izippun saate gaara.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Fettii Samaara katama maachita yinna doochitippa hyaatsi kixxodes yi7ida. Yesuusa yinna maachitigo, «Tana hyaatsi ushshoya» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Yinna wodite Yesuusa tamaaruntsi katstsa wonggodes katama qitenyeshsha.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Yinna maachita mahi, «Ne Ayhude asi maaqqitera, Samaara maacho maaqqide tana wayzi hyaatsi ushsho ga7e?» yagayda. Yinno iza gaydanna Ayhudunts Samaaruntsara yellinttoosse gisho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Izi. 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1-2">Nah. 4:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ne Xoozze imotitsin hyaatsi tana ushsho gaaze oode yezako erizebaz maaqqizako eza ne woossoda; yezin nees de7o inggize hyaatsi inggodyeshsha» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Maachita mahi, «Laatstsayo, nees duuqqize hyale baaya; doochitan hyaako. Yeezin, de7o inggize hyaatsi ne abappa ekkode? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Nuus hyanna hyaatsi doochito inggide nu aday Yayqoobappa ne aadhode? Een, E na7untsin E hyaaruntsii hyanna hyaatsi doochitippa uzhida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesuusa, «Hyanna hyaatsitippa uzhize ooden mahi baridhdhada. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Yezin ta inggode hyaatsito uzhize ooden medhinas baridhdhaama. Ta inggode hyaatsita E gidda medhina de7o inggize goggize hyaatsi aafe maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Maachita mahi, «Laatstso, taanii baridhdhaame gaaran hyaatsi duuqqodes hyanna besite ye7aame fana taas yinna hyaatsito inggo» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesuusa iigo, «hyanggi ne azinza xeegii yo7o» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Maachita mahi, «Taas azini baaya» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesuusa iigo, «Taas azinii baaya ga7i turo ohida. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Nees tiino ichchin azinutsi yene. Hyatte neera yeze atstsay nees azinii baaya. Ne hyatte turo ohida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Maachita mahi, «Laatstso, ne nabe maaqqidanno ta erida. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Nu aduntsi hyay derizella Xoozi goynida. Yezin yin Ayhudunts asi Xoozi goynodes beezize besita Yerusalaame yene gaane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesuusa, «Hyanna maachite tana ammano; hyay derizella woy Yerusalaame Adaya yin goynaame wode ye7oda. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Yin Samaaruntsi erinttooses goynane. Yezin nuunii ashshize Ayhudeppa ye7ize gisho nu erizaya goynane. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Yezin Adaya turippa goynizuntsi Ayyaanaran turotitsara goynize wodita ukkida; hyatten yellida. Yikke, Aday koyze hyannii gaar ogera goynizuntsana. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Xoozze Ayyaana; ees goynizuntsi Ayyaanaran turotitsara goynodes beezane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Maachita mahi, «Kiristtoosa gaaze tizhinttide yo7odanno ta erane. E ye7ize wode nuus ubba baz ohoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesuusa, «Hyay neera ohinttize taanii eza» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Un ohinttodera, Yesuusa tamaaruntsi hyanggide besitippa maaqqida. Yesuusa maachitira ohinttodera un bi7i gaama qoppida. Yezin maachitigo, «Akko koye?» Woy Yesuusago, «Izira akkos ohintte?» gayde ooden baaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, maachita fa hyaatsi otto ashshii suuba katama hyanggi asuntsago, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Taanii oochchidanno ubba taas ohide atstsa bo7odes yedhdhote. E Kiristtoosa maaqqane?» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Asuntsi katamappa kezii Yesuusago hyanggida.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Yinna yi7adera, E tamaaruntsi Yesuusago, «Mo7oyo» ga7i woossida.<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Yezin E, «Taas yin eroosse katstsa ta muuze yene» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Yinnii gisho, E tamaaruntsi fa gidda, «Ees muuze baz asi ki7ikaayzara attaama?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Ta katsita tana kiitteze qoftto oochchodannon E oochito faaddodanno. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Yin, ‹Oyddii aginappa suuba katstsa maxinttoda› gaane baa? Yezin taanii yinttis ohine; katsita kaxxin shiishes yellidanno loytsii bo7ote. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Budizen maxizen wolla ufayttode gaar maxizay damooze ekkane mahi katstsa medhina de7oos aafe shiishane. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Yikke, ‹Fete budane; hyankkay mahi maxane› gaaze ohita turo. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Yin labbikaayzanno shiishode gaar ta yinttana kiittida. Melluntsi oochchii labbidanne gelii yin un labbide aafto ekkida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Maachita, «E, ta oochchide ubbabazito ohida» ga7i markkidhide gisho yinna katamite yeze Samaara asuntsappa gaamuntsi Yesuusa ammanida. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Samaara asuntsin Yesuusago yi7i, un kale gam7ode gaar Yesuusa woossin E ize lam77i qamma bettida.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>E ohide qaaltti gisho kasennippa gaama asuntsi ammanida. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Mahi un maachitigo, «Hyatte nu ammanidanna nu ommite E gaazanno si7ide gishop attin ne markkidhide gisho baaya. Mahin E turo hyanna alamito ashshiza maaqqizanno nu erida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa shuumize na7aya fatstsida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Lam77i qammappa suuba, Yesuusa yinnippa kezii Galila qitida. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Yesuusa fa ommite, «Nabe fa gadite bonchchinttoos» yaga7i tiinidhii ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Maato. 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar. 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luqa. 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Yesuusa Galila yelide wode Galila asuntsi eza mokkida. Akkos gayko, Faasiga Ba7ale bonchchize wode un Yerusalaame yeze gisho E oochchidanno ubba bi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Waha. 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Yesuusa hyaatsito woyne ushi laammide besite, Galila yeze Qaana katama hyanggida. Qifirnahoome kaati keetstsa oocize shuumizes na7i hyargginttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Waha. 2:1-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Yesuusa Yihudappa Galila yiidanno ye shuumize si7i eego yi7ida. Hyayqqodes yellide fa na7aya hyanggi fatstsode gaar Yesuusa woossida.<verse eid="JHN 4:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesuusa Shuumizego, «Xoozii oochchize gaama qofizen kille bazi bi7ikaayzara yin mulon ammanoos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Shuumizen mahi, «Laatstsayo, ta na7ay hyayqqikaayzin taara yedhdhoya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesuusa, «Ne kara qito; ne na7ay faxoda» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ye shuumize Yesuusa ohide qaaltto ammanii fa kara qitida. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>E fa kara hyanggodera eza arunts eego yi7itera ezar oge yellintti, «Ne na7ay faxida» gayda.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>E fa aruntsana fa na7ays akko saate lo77ezako oocida. Un mahi, «Omatse laappun saate michita ashshida» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Na7ay aday Yesuusa faago, «Ne na7ay faxoda» gaydanna yinna saate maaqqidanno tiirida. Yinnii gisho, ezin E kara asunts ubbuntsara ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Yinna Yesuusa Yihudappa Galila yi7i oochchide lam7intsa kille baz.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fettii wobbo atstsa fatstsida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Yesuusa Ayhuduntsi bonchchize baales Yerusalaame qitida. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Yerusalaame Duro furtsi kale Ibraysxe doonara Beetesayda gaaze teqinttide geenna yene. Ye teqintti yeze hyaatsiti kale kanggizen ke7ize ichchin oge yene. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>[Yinne hyaatsita en7inttizanno naagize] gaama hyargginttizuntsi, qooquntsi, wobbuntsin galla siliduntsi woy7ida. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>[Akkos gayko, fettii fettii tohe Laatstse kiitanchcho geenite wodhdhii hyaatsito en7izane. Hyaatsita en7ize wode tiinii gelide atstse fana aykkide akko hyarggeppa faxane.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii zaga maxaafuntsi faydo hyaydzdzis tiino baggiton faydo oyddii gujjoos.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Yinna besite hyastam osfun bere hyargginttide fettii asi yene. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesuusa ize woy7ide atstsa bi7i, mahi gaama wode hyargginttidanno erii atstsego, «Faxodes koyane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Hyargganchchize mahi, «Laatstso, hyaatsita en7inttize wode tana hyaatsite olize asi baaya. Ta gelodes yiyoder melluntsi taappa tiinii gelane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesuusa eego, «Denddii eqqo; ne alggiza tookkii qito» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Atstsay iira faxida; fa alggiza tookkii qitida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Yinna Sambbata wode hyanida. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Yinnii gisho, Ayhudunts faxide atstsego, «Hyayno sa7ita Sambbata; neenii ne alggiza tookkizanna woga baaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Nah. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Er. 17:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Yezin atstsay, «Tana fatstseze, ‹ne alggiza tookkii qito› gayda» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Un eego, «Nena, ne alggiza tookkii qito gayde E oode?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Yezin Yesuusa yinna besite gaama as giddappa deshshi gayde gisho atstsay fana fatstside oode yezako erikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Yesuusa suubappa ye atstsa Xoozze Keetstsa denggi, «Hyaychche, ne faxida; hyannippa aadhize iita baz nena yellaame gaar mahi nagara oochchippe» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, atstsay hyanggi fana fatstside Yesuusa maaqqizanno Ayhuduntsis ohida.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Yesuusa yinno Sambbata ode oochchide gisho Ayhudunts Yesuusa baytstse aykkida. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta Aday ubba wode oochchane; taanin oochchodes beezane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Yesuusa Sambbata bonchchikaayze gisho xalaalas maaqqikaayzin Xoozza fa Ade ga7i fana Xoozara wolkkizide gisho Ayhudunts eza wodhodes tiinonnippa mintsii koyda.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze Na7ay adetits wolqqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; Na7ay faas akkon oochchodes dandda7oos. E fa Aday oochchodera bi7idanno xalaala oochchane. Aday oochchizanno Na7ayin oochchane. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Aday fa Na7aya kadhize gisho oochchize oocha ubba fa Na7aya beezane. Yin gaama qoppode gaar E hyannippa aadhize oocha fa Na7aya beezoda. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Aday hyayqqiduntsana hyayqoppa dentsii unttis de7o inggizannigaara Na7ayin fa koyezuntsis de7o inggane. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Aday Na7ays firddode gaar adetits wolqqa inggidap attin E oonan firddoos. <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>Yinno E oochchidanna Asi ubba Adaya bonchchizanni gaar Na7ayan bonchchode fana. Na7aya bonchchoosse ooden Na7aya kiittide Adayan bonchchoos.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; ta qaaltto si7izes tana kiitteza ammanzes medhina de7o yene. E hyayqoppa de7o fiinggide gisho firddinttoos. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; hyayqqide asuntsi Xoozze Na7ay qaaltto si7ize wode ye7oda; yinnan hyatte. E qaaltto si7ize de7o yessada. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Aday faas de7o yezanni fana Na7aysin de7o yessade fana inggida. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Na7ay As Na7a maaqqide gisho Aday Na7ays firddode gaar adetits wolqqa inggida.<verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>«Booza yezuntsi E qaaltto si7i denddize wode ye7ode gisho hyanne gaama qoppipete. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Lo77o oochchiduntsi de7o dendddes mahi iita oochchiduntsi firdda ekkodes boozappa denddoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dane. 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusas markkidhide asuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>«Taanii ta adetitsi wolqqara akko bazin oochchodes dandda7oos. Xoozze taas ohidanni gaar firddane. Taanii tana kiittide koyze baz oochchanep attin ta koyze baz oochchoose gisho ta firddita turo.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>«Taanii ta baz markkidhiko ta markkatitsita turo maaqqoos. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Ta baz markkidhize melle yene; E ta baz markkidhizanna turo maaqqizanno ta erane.<verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>«Yin Wahannisago asi kiittin E turis markkidhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Waha. 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Ta yinno yinttis ohizanna, yin attode gaar gaydap attin asi markkatitsi taas koshshin baaya. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Wahannisa goga gaar eexize foo7o. Yin eerats wode E foo7ite ufayttodes koyda.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>«Yezin taas Wahannisappa aadhize markka yene. Ta oochchode gaar ta Aday taas inggide oochita ta baz markkidhane; Aday tana kiittezanno beezane.<verse eid="JHN 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>«Mahin tana kiittide Aden fa ommite ta baz markkidhane. Yin E qaaltto mulo si7ikaaya woy E bishshito bi7ikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luqa. 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>E kiittezanno yin ammanoose gisho E qaaltta yin wozintte baaya.<verse eid="JHN 5:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>«Geeshi Maxaafuntsappa medhina de7o denggodebaz yinttis aazin un qurichchane; qaalttan ta baz markkidhane. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Yezin yin de7o denggodes taago yo7odes koyoos.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>«Asappa taanii bonchcho koyoos. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Yezin taanii yin wozintte Xoozze siiqo baayzanno erane. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Taanii ta Aday suntsite yi7ida, yezin tana mokkikaaya. Hyankay fa suntsite ye7iza mokkane. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Yin fete feteppa bonchcho koyzuntsi, fettii Xoozzeppa ye7ize bonchcho ekkodes koyoosuntsi, wayzi tana ammanodes dandda7ode?<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>«Taanii ta Aday tiino yinttana mootizebazi yinttis aazippe. Yinttana mootode yin ufaytti kafize Muse. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Yin Muse ammanezako E ta baz xaafide gisho tanan ammanodyeshsha. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Yezikon yin E xaafidanno ammanaanxxiko ta qaaltto wayzi ammanode?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ichchin mukul asuntsana muuzida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Maato. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luqa. 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Yesuusa Xibaaryoosa gaaze Galila Abbap seko gaxa fiinggida. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>E hyargganchchuntsana fatstsi kille baz oochchidanno bi7ide gisho gaama asuntsi eza kaallida. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesuusa derella kezii, yeyga fa tamaaruntsara wolla bettida. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Ayhuduntsi bonchchize Faasiga Ba7ale ukkida. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesuusa gaama asunts faago ye7izanno bi7i Filphoosago, «Hyantsi asuntsana ubba muusades maaqqade katstsa abappa wonggode?» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>E yinno Filphoosa fattanodes gaydap attin E fa ommite akko oochchodyezako erane.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filphoosa mahi Yesuusago, «Melle atto yezin, omma omma, fettii fettii baaritsi yelitsodes, lam77i xeet dinaarera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dinaare gaaze bira: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii dinaare fettii asi fettii wode oochchii feezhii ekkize bira. Lam77i xeet dinaare fettii asi fettii bere bagga oochchii ekkize bira gaara. (Maato 20:2) bo7ote. </char></note> boora wonggikon maaqqoos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Mahi Yesuusa tamaaruntsappa fete, Simoon Phexiroosa ishe Inddiriyase, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Ichchin beshe bangga booran lam77i molo aykkide fettii na7a hyanne yene, yezin hyantsi asunts ubbas yinna akko maaddode?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Asuntsana betitsote» yagayda. Yinna besite gaama buca yene; asuntsi ubba bettida. Dhiiratsi asunts faydita ichchin mukul maaqqada. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesuusa booriza ekkii Xooz galatii maaqqii fa tamaaruntsis inggida. Unttin bettide asuntsis yeltsida. Moltton ekkii yinnii fana yiizii inggin, asuntsi fa koydanni gaar muyda. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Un ubbuntsi mizhidannippa suuba Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Fettibazin iitaame gaar attide gufto shiishote» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Yinnii gisho, un ubba shiishida. Asuntsi mu7in attide bangga boora gufa shiishin taphpho lam77i leemate maaqqida.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Asuntsi Yesuusa oochchide kille baz be7eze wode «Hyay turo hyanna alamtte ye7oda ga7inttide nabiza» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesuusa un eza aykkii wolqqara kaati mahodes hyanzanno erii, faas derella mahi kezida.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa abballa yedhdhii hyanggida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Maato. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Sa7ita ugurin Yesuusa tamaaruntsi abbago wodhdhida. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Sa7ita qammide gishon Yesuusa hyaga unttago yi7ikaayze gisho E tamaaruntsi gonggite gelii abba fiinggi Qifirnahoome qitodes denddida. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Damma baqo baqqide gisho abba hyaatsita en7ida. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Ichchin woy izippun kilo mitire maaqqade gaar un abballa hyanggidannippa suuba Yesuusa abballa yedhdhitera ye7izanno bi7i zhashtida. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Yezin E, «Zhashtippete, tana» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Un ufaytti eza gonggite geltsida; iira gonggize un hyanggize abba gaxa yellida.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa de7o boora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Wonttistti wode abbappa seko gaxa attide gaama asuntsi fettii gongge xalaala yezanno bi7ida. Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsara gonggite gelii, unttara hyanggoosannon un fa faas hyanggidanno bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Yezin Xibaaradoosappa melle gongguntsi Yesuusa Xooz galatin, asuntsi boora muyde bessito yi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Asuntsi Yesuusa woy E tamaaruntsi ize baayzanno bi7i, Yesuusa koyodes gonggite gelii Qifirnahoome qitida.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Asuntsi Yesuusa abbappa seko fintsa denggide wode «Asttamaarizayo, hyanne ayde ne yiido?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii yinttis turo turo gaane; yin tana koyzanna boora mu7i mizhide gishop attin kille baz bi7ide gisho baaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Dhabize katstsas oochippete, yezin medhina de7o yeze katstsa inggize As Na7ays oochchote. Ezan Xoozze Aday attamii tillizida.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Yeezin un, «Nuunii Xoozze oocha oochchodes akko oochchode?» yaga7i Yesuusa oocida.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yin oochchode gaar Xoozze koyze oochita hyanno: E kiittidaya ammanode fana» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Un mahi, «Nuunii bi7i, nena ammanode gaar akko kille baz ne beessade? Ne akko oochchode? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, ‹Un ma7ade gaar boora saloppa inggida› ga7intti xaafinttidannigaara nu aduntsi akko baayze ganasa manna muyda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:4">Keze 6:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Maz. 78:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesuusa, «Ta yinttis turo ohine; yinttis saloppa turii boora inggide ta Adayp attin Muse baaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Yikke, Xoozii inggize boora saloppa wodhdhide alames de7o inggizaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Un mahi, «Laatstso, nuus ye booriza ubba wode inggo» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii de7o boora; taago ye7ize ooden mulo naydhdhoos. Mahi tana ammanze atstsen baridhdhoos. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohida; yin tana bi7ida, yezin ammanikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Ta Aday taas inggide ubbuntsi taago yo7oda; mahi taago ye7iza oonan bale dakkoos. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Taanii ta koyze baz oochchodes maaqqikaayzin tana kiittide koyze baz oochchodes saloppa yi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Tana kiittide koyzanna hyanno: taanii E taas inggide ubbuntsana wurssutsi wode hyayqoppa dentsode gaarap attin feten dhabode gaar koyoos. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Yikke, ta Aday koyzanna yinno: Na7aya bi7i ammanze ubba medhina de7o ekkoda; taanii yentsana ubba wurssutsi wode medhina de7os hyayqoppa dentsoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii saloppa wodhdhide boora» gayde gisho Ayhuduntsi eella zuuzinggida. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Un, «Hyayni nu E adayan E intto erize Yoosefa Na7a Yesuusa baane? Yeezin, E wayzi, ‹Ta saloppa wodhdhida› gawudes dandda7e?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Fete fetera zuuzinggizanno ashshote. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Tana kiittide ta Aday taago ki7ize asappa attin taago yo7odes dandda7ize ooden baaya. Ta wurssutsi wode eza medhina de7os hyayqoppa dentsoda. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Nabuntsi, ‹Asi ubba Xoozappa tamaariduntsana maaqqada› ga7i xaafida. Adaya si7izen eeppa tamaaride ooden taago ye7ine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa. 54:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Xoozze kaleppa yi7idayip attin Adaya be7eze ooden baaya; E xalaala Adaya bi7ida.<verse eid="JHN 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>«Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; tana ammanize medhina de7o yene. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Taanii de7o boora. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Yin aduntsi akko baayze ganas sa7a manna mu7ida, yezin hyayqqida. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Saloppa yi7ide boora hyaya; hyay booriza mu7ide ooden hyayqqoos. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Saloppa yi7ide de7o boorize tana. Ooden hyay booriza mu7iko medhinas yessada. Mahi hyanna alamita de7o yessade gaar taanii yinttis inggode boorize ta ashito» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Ayhuduntsi, «Hyay atstsay fa ashito nu ma7ade gaar nuus wayzi inggodes dandda7e?» yaga7i fa gidda wolla lallida.<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa unttago, «Taanii yinttis turo turo gaane; As Na7ay ashito, yin ma7anxko, mahi E suutsito yin uzhanxiko, yinttis de7o baaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ta ashito mu7izen ta suutsito uzhize atstses medhina de7o yene. Taanii wurssutsi wode eza hyayqoppa dentsoda. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ta ashita turii katstsa; ta suutsitan turii ushi. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ta ashito mu7izen ta suutsito uzhize atstse ta gidda yene; taanin E gidda yene. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>De7o Aday tana kiittin, ta E baggara de7o yezannigaara, tana mu7ize atstsen ta baggara de7o yessada. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Saloppa wodhdhide boorize hyaya: yin aduntsi mu7i hyayqqide manna fana baaya; hyay booriza mu7ize atstse medhina yessada» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesuusa Qifirnahoome katama Ayhude woosa Keetstsa hyanno tamaarssida.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Medhina de7o qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsappa gaama baggita yinno si7eze wode «Hyanna geloose timirtte; oodes gele?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsi yinnis zuuzinggidanno erii, «Hyanna yinttana balitsane? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Yeezin, As Na7ay tiino fa yeze bessa ude kessadera yin bi7izako wayade? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Geeshi Ayyaana de7o inggane; as wolqqa akkon maaddoos. Ta yinttis ohize qaaltta de7o inggize Geeshi Ayyaanappa yi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Yezin yin gidda ammanoosunts yene» yagayda. Ammanoosuntsi ood yezako Yesuusa tiinoppan erane. Mahi fana aatsii inggode oona yezako erane. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Mahin Yesuusa, «Aday yo7o gaykaayze ooden taago yo7odes dandda7oos ga7i ta ohizanna yinnii gisho» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Yinnii baggara, Yesuusa kaallizuntsappa gaamuntsi eza ashshii suub maaqqida; maaqqin eera hyanggikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Yesuusa taphpho lam77i fa tamaaruntsana, «Yinttin ashshii qitodes koyane?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simoon Phexiroosa mahi, «Laatstso, nuunii oodego qitode? Nees medhina de7o qaala yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68-69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Maato. 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mar. 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luqa. 9:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Ne Xoozze Geeshi maaqqidanno nuunii ammananen erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Ta yinttana taphpho lam77untsana doorikaane? Yezin yinttappa fete Xalahe» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Yesuusa yinno gaydanna Simoona Na7ay Asqorootu Yihuda gisho. Yihuda Yesuusa aatsii inggodes yeze taphpho lam77i tamaaruntsappa feta.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusaran E ishuntsara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Ayhuduntsi Yesuusa wodhodes koyde gisho E Yihuda ashshii Galilara wutida. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Ayhuduntsi bonchchize daase Ba7ale ukkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Leewe 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Mahe 16:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa ishuntsi, «Ne tamaaruntsi ne oochchize kille bazito be7ade gaar hyannippa denddii Yihuda sa7a qito. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Faas qonccii erinttodes koyze asi ooden fa oochito aachoos. Ne hyantsesana oochchii nebaz alames qonccizo» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>E ishuntsi yinno gaydanna ammanikaayze gisho.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Taas wode hyaga yellikaaya, yezin yinttis ubba wode wottane. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Alame yinttana ixxodes dandda7oos, yezin taanii alame oochita iita maaqqizanno markkidhize gisho tana ixxane. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Yin ba7aalito qitote; taas wode yellikaayze gisho taanii ba7alito hyanggoos» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>E yinno ga7i Galila attida.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ba7ale bonchchodes qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>E ishuntsi ba7ale bonchchodes qitidanippa maaqqii Yesuusa ooden erikaayzin benttikaayzara yinna besite hyanggida. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Ayhudunts ba7ale bonchchize besite, «E aba yene?» yaga7i eza koyda.<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Asuntsi zuuzinggii E baz ohinttane. Bagguntsi, «E lo77o asi» gaaze wode melluntsi mahi, «Ade, E as balitstsane» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Yezin Ayhude hyalaquntsis zhashtide gisho ooden E baz qoncce ohinttoos.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Ba7ale bonchchii gidda yellodera Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa hyanggi tamaarsse aykkida. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Ayhuduntsi, «Hyay atstse timirtte tamaarikaayzara maxaafe wayzi erido?» ga7i gaama qoppida.<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta tamaarssize timirttita tana kiitteze Xoozze kaleppa ye7ize timirttep attin ta baz baaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Xoozze qofa oochchodes koyze ooden hyanna timirttita Xoozze kaleppa ye7izakon woy taanii taappa ohizako erane. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Fa baz ohize ooden fa bonchcho koyane. Yezin fana kiitteze bonchcho koyze ooden E turii asi; E gidda worddo baaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Muse yinttis higge inggida, yezin yinttappa ooden higge naagikaaya. Yeezin akkos tana wodhodes koye?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Asuntsi mahi, «Neera Xalahe yene; nena wodhodes oode koyze?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesuusa, «Ta fettii kille baz oochchin yin ubbuntsi gaama qoppida. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Yin, yin na7untsana garrazode gaar Muses woga inggida. Yezin yin mayzuntsappa aykkii yeze wogap attin Muse baaya. Yinnii gisho, yin Sambbata wode dhiiratsi na7untsana garrazane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medho 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Muse higge sharinttaame fana yin Sambbata wode garrazzebaz maaqqiko, ta fettii atstse kumutsi gallito Sambbatar fatstside gisho taara akkos kacintte?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Waha. 5:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Turii firdda firddotep attin as sino bi7i firddippete» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa, E Kiristtoosa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Yerusalaame asuntsappa fete fete, «Un wodhodes koyze atstse hyaya baane? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Yikke, E qoncce ohine; un eza akkon ga7oos. E Kiristtoosa maaqqidanno Ayhude hyalaquntsi turo eresoone? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Kiristtoosa ye7ize wode E abappa yezako ooden eroos, yezin hyay atstse anappa ye7ezako nu erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesuusa Xoozze Keetstsa tamaarssitera fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Turo yin ta oona yezakon ta abap ye7ezako erane? Taanii ta wolqqara yi7ikaaya, yezin tana kiitteze turii ade; yin eza eroos. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Yezin taanii E kiittin E kaleppa yi7ide gisho eza erane» yaga7i uukkida.<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Yinnii gisho, un eza aykkodes koyda. Yezin Ees wode hyaga yellikaayze gisho ooden eella kushe gaddikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Yezin gaama asuntsi Yesuusa ammanii, «Kiristtoosa ye7ize wode hyay atstse oochchize kille bazappa aatsii oochchodaane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa aykkodes wottaddaruntsi kiitinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Farisaawunutsi gaama asuntsi Yesuusa baz kalkashizanno si7ida. Kahinunts hyalaquntsin Farisaawunutsi eza aytsii acissades Xoozze keetstsa naagizuntsana kiittida.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesuusa, «Ta yinttara eerats wode gam77oda; yinnippa suuba tana kiittezego qitoda. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Yin tana koyoda, yezin denggaama. Ta yeze bestto yin yo7odes dandda7oos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Ayhuduntsi fete fetera, «Hyay nu denggaame bessa aba qitodes yiye? Girike katama bettii yeze Ayhuduntsana hyanggi tamaarssodes qitodaane? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>‹Yin tana koyoda, yezin denggaama› mahi, ‹Taanii yeze bessa yin yo7odes dandda7aama› gaazanna akki ga7intte?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">De7o hyaatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Ba7ale bonchchize hyal7e qammite Yesuusa denddii, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Baridhdhide ooden taago yi7i uzho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Leewe 23:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Tana ammanze ooden Geeshi Maxaafta gaydannigaara de7o inggize hyaatsi aafe E giddappa goggane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hiz. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zakka. 14:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>E yinno gaydanna eza ammanezunts ekkodes yeze Geeshi Ayyaanabaz ohida. Yesuusa hyaga bonchchinttikaayze gisho ye wode Geeshi Ayyaana ingginttikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asunts gidda dummatitsi medhinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Yentsi asuntsappa gaamuntsi E gaazanno si7i, «Hyay turo yo7oda ga7inttide nabizaya»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyanna besite nabe ga7intteze ye7oda ga7i un naagize nabiza qonccizane. (Waha. 1:21 bo7ote) </char></note> yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Melluntsi mahi, «Hyay Kiristtoosa» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Mahin mellunts, «Kiristtoosa Galilappa ye7inene? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, ‹Kiristtoosa Dawute kochchappa Dawute yezide Beeteleme katamappa ye7oda› gaykaane?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam. 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik. 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa baggara asunts wol gidda shaakkinttida. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Yentsi asuntsappa fete fete eza aykkodes koyda, yezin ooden eella kushe gaddikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhude hyalaquntsi ammanikaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Xoozze Keetstsi naagizuntsi kahinunts hyalaquntsagon Farisaawunutsago suub maaqqii yi7in un, «Akkos eza ke7anxxido?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Xoozze Keetstsi naagizuntsi unttago, «Hyay atstse ohizanni gaara ooden ohoos» ga7i mahida.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Farisaawununtsi mahi, «E yinttanan balitstsida? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Ayhude hyalaquntsappa woy Farisaawuntsappa eza ammanide asi yene? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Muse higge eroosse hyantsi asuntsi tuneezuntsana» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Farisaawuntsappa fete qamma Yesuusago hyanggide Niqodimoosa unttago,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Waha. 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Fettii asi gaazanno si7ikaayzara woy E akko oochchezako erikaayzara tiino eella firddizanna nu higgite yene?» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Un mahi, «Neenin Galila asi? Galila sa7appa nabe kezaamanno Geeshi Maxaafeppa qurichchi ero» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Yinnippa suuba fete fete fa kara qitida.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Olale hyanttera aykinttide maachito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Fete fete ashshii fa kara fa kara qitida, yezin Yesuusa Shamahe dere qitida. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Mahi wonttistti wode gooda Xoozze keetstsa yi7ida. Gaama asuntsi eego yi7in bettii unttana tamaarssida. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawunutsi olalodera aykkide fettii maachito eego ki7ida. Un as ubba tiino izo essi, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>«Asttamaarizayo, hyanna maachita olalodera nu aykkida. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Muse higge hyannii gaarize maachito shuchchara dhogii wodhode gaar kiittane. Yeezin, ne ibaz waage?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Leewe 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Mahe 22:22-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Un yinno gaydanna Yesuusa fattanii eza mootodebaz denggodes. Yezin Yesuusa zuggii fa gil7izera sa7alla xaafida. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Un eza mahi mahi oocii ashshanxin, ude dhoqi ga7i, «Yin gidda nagara oochchikaayze asi tiinii izo shuchchara dhogo» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Mahin zuggii sa7alla xaafida.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Un yinno si7ide wode un qoftta un7in cimuntsappa aykkii fete fete kezitera hyal7ida. Yesuusa xalaala yinna besite eqqide maachitira attida. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>E ude dhoqi ga7i maachitippa melle asi bi7ikaayze wode, «Maachite, mootizunts aba qitido? Neella firddizuntsappa ooden baa?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Maachita, «Laatstso, ooden baaya» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesuusa mahi, «Taanin neella firddoos. Qito; mahi nagara oochchippe» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa alames foo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Mahin Yesuusa asuntsago, «Taanii alames foo7o. Tana kaallize ooden de7o inggize foo7o ekkodap attin dhuma hyanttoos» yaga7i ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Maato. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Waha. 9:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Farisaawuntsi, «Ne nebaz markkidhane, yezin ne markkatitsita turo baaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Waha. 5:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii ta baz markkidhizakon ta markkatitsita turo. Akkos gayko, taanii abappa ye7ezako mahi aba qitizako erane, yezin yin ta abappa ye7izakon mahi aba qitizako eroos. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Yin as qofa gaar firddane; taanii fettii asallan firddoos. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Taanii firddizebaz maaqqikon ta firddita turo. Akkos gayko, tana kiitteze ta Aday taara yenep attin taanii ta xalaala yezoos. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Lam77i asi markkatitsi turo maaqqizanna yin higgite xaafinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Mahe 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Taanii ta baz ta ommite markkidhane; mahi tana kiitteze ta Aden ta baz markkidhane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Un, «Ne aday aba yene?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesuusa mahi, «Yin tana woy ta Adaya eroos. Tana erizebaz maaqqizako, yin ta Adayan eroda yeshsha» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesuusa Xoozze Keetstsa muxaate bira olize saaxine yeze besite yinno tamaarssida. E qammita hyaga yellikaayze gisho ooden eza aykkikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Mahin Yesuusa unttago, «Ta qitoda; yin tana koyoda, yezin yin yin nagarttira hyayqqoda. Ta qitize bestto qitodes yin dandda7oos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Ayhude hyalaquntsi, «E, ‹Ta qitize bestto yin yo7odes dandda7oos› yagayda. E fana faas wodhoda yessane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yin oomoppa; ta afappa. Yin hyanna alamttippa, ta hyanna alamttippa baaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Yin yin nagarttira hyayqqoda ga7i ta yinttis ohidanna yinnis. Taanii Tana maaqqizanno yin ammananxiko yin yin nagarttira hyayqqoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Un, «Ne oode?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii, tiinoppa yinttis ohide ezii tana. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Taanii yin baz ohi firddize gaama baz yene. Yezin tana kiitteze turo; mahi taanii eeppa si7ezanno xalaala alames ohine» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Yesuusa fa Adebaz ohizanno un tiirikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa unttago, «Yin As Na7aya ude dhoqi yiize wode Taanii Tana Maaqqizanno yin eroda. Mahin taanii ta adetitsi wolqqara akkon oochchosannon ta Aday tana tamaarssidanno ohizanno yin eroda. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Tana kiitteze taara yene. Ta ubba wode eza ufayssize baz oochchize gisho E tana ta xalaala ashshikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Yesuusa yinno ohodera si7eze gaama asuntsi eza ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nagara arotitsappa keze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yesuusan fana ammanide Ayhuduntsago, «Yin ta qaaltte yeziko turii ta tamaaruntsana. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Yin turo eroda; turitan yinttana arotitsappa kessoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Un mahi, «Nu Abrahama kochchi; nu oodesin aridhdhikaaya. Ne wayzi, ‹Yin arotitsappa kessada› ga7e?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Maato. 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luqa. 3:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; nagara oochchize ooden nagaras aro. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Aro medhinas kara asara yezoos, yezin na7a medhinas kara asara yezane. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Na7ay yinttana arotitsappa kessiko yin arotitsappa turo kessada. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Yin Abrahama kochchi maaqqizanno ta erane. Yezin ta qaaltta yin gidda baayze gisho tana wodhodes koyane. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Taanii ta Aday tana beezidanno ohine, yezin yinttin yin adeppa be7ezanno oochchane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Un mahi, «Nu aday Abrahama» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesuusa unttago, «Yin Abrahama na7untsana maaqqizako E oochchidanno oochchodyeshsha. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Yezin Xoozappa si7eze turtto ohide tana yin wodhodes koyane. Abrahama yinnii gaara yiizikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Yin, yin aday oochchidanno oochchane» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Un mahi, «Nuunii olale na7a baaya turii Xoozze na7untsana; nuus fettii Aday Xoozze xalaala yene» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Xoozii turii yinttis aday maaqqizako yin tana kadhodyeshsha; akkos gayko, taanii Xoozze kaleppa yi7ida. Tana E kiittanep attin taanii ta adetits wolqqara yi7ikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Ta ohizanno yin si7osanna tiiroso? Ta qaaltto yin si7anxide gisho. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Yin, yin aday Xalahe na7a. Mahin yin, yin aday amudhdhizebaz oochchodes koyane. E tiinoppa aykkii shemppo wodhizaya. Turii E gidda baayze gisho E turo ixxane. Worddo ees yeze baz maaqqide gishon E worddos ade maaqqide gisho worddo ohitera faappa ohine. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Ta turito ohine, yezin yin tana ammanoos. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Yinttappa, ‹Ne nagara oochchodera ta bi7ida› gawudes dandda7ize oode? Ta turito ohize baz maaqqiko tana akkos ammanoste? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Xoozze asi maaqqide Xoozii gaazanno si7ine. Yin Xoozze asi maaqqikaayze gisho Xoozii gaazanno si7oos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Abrahameppa tiino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayhuduntsi mahi, « ‹Ne Samaara asi; neella tuna ayyaana yene› ga7itera likke nu baane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesuusan unttago «Taalla tuna ayyaana baaya. Taanii ta Adaya bonchchane, yezin yin tana leqqane. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Taanii ta bonchcho koyoos; ta bonchchinttode gaar koyzen taas firddize yene. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; ta qaaltto naagize ooden hyayqqoos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Ayhuduntsi mahi, «Neella tuna ayyaana yezanno nuunii hyatte erida. Abrahama hyayqqida; nabuntsin hyayqqida. Yezin ne, ‹Ta qaaltto naagize ooden hyayqqoos› yagaane. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Ne hyayqqide nu aday Abrahameppa aadhane? Nabuntsin hyayqqida. Ne nena oona ga7i qoppe?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii tana bonchchiko ta bonchchita hyarii. Yin, ‹Nu Xoozza› gaaze ta Aday E tana bonchchane. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Yin eza eranxikon ta eza erane. Ta eza eroos gayko yin fana taanin worddidhdhane. Yezin ta eza erane; mahi E qaaltton naagane. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Yin aday Abrahama ta ye7ize qammito bi7i ufayttodes amudhdhane; bi7in ufayttida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ayhuduntsi mahi, «Melle atto yezin, nees ichintam bere kumikaayze wayzi Abrahama bi7ida ga7e?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesuusan unttago, «Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; Abrahama yelinttodannippa tiino Taanii Tana» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Yinnii gisho, un Yesuusa dhogodes shuchchi ekkida. Yezin Yesuusa unttappa genggii Xoozze keetstsappa kezii qitida.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa aafe qooqe maaqqii yelinttide atstsa fatstsida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesuusa hyanggitera yelinttidannippa aafe qooqe maaqqii yeze fettii atstsa bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>E tamaaruntsi, «Asttamaarizayo, hyay atstse aafe qooqe maaqqii yelinttode gaar nagara oochchide oode? Ezaane woy eza yeliduntsi oochchido?» ga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesuusa, «Xoozze oochita eella qonccode gaarap attin ezii woy eza yeliduntsi nagara oochchide gisho baaya. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Sa7a awara yezin tana kiittide oochito oochchodes beezane. Ooden oochchodes dandda7oosse qamma yo7oda. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Ta alamite yezitera alamttis foo7o» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Maato. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Waha. 8:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Yesuusa yinno ga7i sa7alla cuttida. Fa cuchchitira eerats sa7a laakitsii yinna looqitira aafe qooqe atstse aafto tizhida. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Yeyzi, «Hyanggi Salihoome (Salihoome ga7inttizanna Kiitinttidaya ga7e) gaaze teqinttide hyaatsite ne aafto matto» yagayda. Yinnii gisho, atstse hyanggi fa aafto mattii bi7itera maaqqida.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Dootsuntsin atstse tiino woossodera bi7ide asuntsi, «Hyay bettii woossize atstsa baane?» gayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Fettii fettii asuntsi, «Hyay eza» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Melluntsi mahi, «Ade, hyayni eza aazanep attin eza baaya» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Yezin ezin, «Yee, tana» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Un eego, «Yeezin ne aafta wayzi bi7ido?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>E mahi, «Yesuusa gaaze atstse looqa laakitsii ta aafto tizhii, ‹Salihoome hyanggi ne aafto matto› yaga7in, ta hyanggi mattii bi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Un eego, «E aba yene?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Atstsay, «Ta eroos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisaawuntsi hyanidanno erodes koyda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Un aafe qooqe yezara, bi7ide atstsa Farisaawuntsago kanggida. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Yesuusa looqa laakitsii atstse aafto fatstside qammita Sambbata. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Yinnii gisho, atstse wayzi be7ezako Farisaawuntsi eza mahi oocida. Atstsay unttago, «E ta aafte looqa tizhida, mattii hyatte be7ine» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Farisaawuntsappa fete fete, «Hyanno oochchide atstse Sambbata higge naagoosse gisho Xoozze kaleppa yi7ikaaya» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Yezin melluntsi, «Nagaranchcho asi hyannii gaar kille baz wayzi oochchodes dandda7e?» ga7i wol gidda shaakkinttida.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Yinnii gisho, Farisaawuntsi atstsego, «E ne aafto bugide gisho ne ebazito waage?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Atstsay, «E nabe» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ayhude hyalaquntsi, E intton adayan xeegii oocode wontsis, atstse tiino aafe qooqe maaqqizannon hyatte E be7izanno ammanikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Un E inttigon E adego, «Yin ‹aafe qooqe maaqqii yelinttida› gaaze yin na7ay hyaya? Yeezin, hyatte wayzi bi7ido?» ga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Eza yeliduntsi, «Hyay nu na7a maaqqidannon aafe qooqe maaqqii E yelinttidanno nu erane. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Yezin hyatte E wayzi be7ezako mahi E aafto oode fatstsezako nu eroos. Eza oocote. E fana shaakkide asi maaqqide gisho fa baz ohodes dandda7ane» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Eza yeliduntsi yinno gaydanna Ayhuduntsis zhashtize gisho. Akkos gayko, Ayhuduntsi, Yesuusa E Kiristtoosa yaga7i markkidhize asi yeziko ye atstsa Ayhude woosa keetstsappa bay7odes tiinii zore accida. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Eza yeliduntsi, «E fana shaakkide asi; eza oocote» yagaydanna yinnisi.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Yinnii gisho, qooqe maaqqii yelinttide atstsa un lam7intsa xeegii, «Xoozza bonchcho; hyay atstsay nagaranchcho maaqqidanno nu erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Atstsay mahi, «E nagaranchcho maaqqizanno ta eroos. Ta qooqe maaqqidannon hyatte bi7idanno yinno fettii baz erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Un mahi, «E nees akko baz oochchido? E ne aafto wayzi fatstsido?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>E unttago, «Ta yinttis tiino ohida, yezin yin si7odes koykaaya. Akkos mahi si7odes koye? Yinttin E tamaare maaqqades koyanene?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Un eza cazhiter yagayda, «Ne ye atstse tamaare; nuunii Muse tamaare. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Xoozii Musera ohinttidanno nu erane, yezin hyay atstse E anappa ye7ezakon nu eroos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Atstsay unttago, «E anappa ye7ezako yin erosanna gaama qofize baz, maaqqikon E ta aafto fatstsida. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Xoozzes zhashtizan E koyze baz oochchize atstsa Xoozii si7inep attin nagaranchchuntsana si7oos. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Salon sa7a medhinttidannippa aafe qooqe maaqqii yelinttide as aafe fatstside ooden baaya. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Hyay atstse Xoozappa maaqqikaayzako fettibazin oochchodes dandda7oos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Un mahi, «Ne kumutsi medhintte nagarar yelintti diccize nuna tamaarssodes koyane?» yagayda. Eza Ayhude woosa keetstsappa bay7ida.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wozina qooqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesuusa un atstsa bale kessidanno si7ide wode eza denggi, «As Na7aya ammanane?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Atstsay Yesuusago, «Laatstso, ta eza ammanode gaar E oode? Taas ohoya?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesuusa atstsego, «Ne eza bi7ida; hyay neera ohinttize eza» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Atstsay mahi, «Laatstso, ta ammanane» yaga7i Yesuusas goynida.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesuusa, «Qooqunts be7ade gaaran be7izuntsi qooqode gaar taanii firddodes hyanna alamite yi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Ezara yeze eerats Farisaawuntsi yinno si7i, «Nu qooqene?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesuusa, «Yin qooqe maaqqizako yinttis nagara maaqqoos yeshsha. Yezin hyatte yin be7ine gaaze gisho yin, yin nagarite yene» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa lo77o wude ade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesuusa, «Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; duro kales furtstsara maaqqikaayzin melle bessara gelize ooden kayzon faannon. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Yezin furtsara gelize ezii duruntsana yenggizaya. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Furtsito naagize ees furtsito bugane; duruntsin E qaaltto si7ine. E fa duruntsana un suntsitira suntsitira xeegane; unttana kaalitsi bale kessane. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>E fa duruntsana ubba bale kessidannippa maaqqii unttap tiinor yedhdhane. Un E qaaltto erize gisho eza kaallane. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Melle qaala un eroosse gisho eeppa hyaakkanep attin eza kaalloos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesuusa unttis hyanna aazizito ohida, yezin E akko ga7ezakon un tiirikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Mahi Yesuusa unttago, «Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; taanii duruntsis furtsi. <figure style="fig" alt="Sheep in sheepfold with shepherd" file="LB00014B.TIF" size="span" ref="10:7">Duro Duro Kalen Yenggizayan </figure> <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Taappa tiino ye7eze ubba kayzon faannop, attin duruntsi unttana si7ikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Furtsize tana; ta baggara gelize ooden attoda. E ta baggara gelodan kessada; lo77o yengginttize bessi demmada. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Kayzo kaystodes, shukkodesin dhabsodes ye7inep attin mellebazis ye7oos. Ta unttis de7o yessade gaaran gaanggode gaar yi7ida.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>«Ta lo77o wude ade; lo77o wude adaya fa duruntsi gisho fa shemppito aatsii inggane. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Kira yenggize atstse duruntsis ade maaqqikaayze gisho suudhume ye7ize wode bi7i duruntsana ashshii woxxane. Yinnii gisho, suudhume duruntsana bonqane duruntsin lanttane. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Kira yenggizay miishes yenggize gishon duruntsbaz ees sinttoosse gisho duruntsana ashshii woxxane.<verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15"/>«Ta lo77o wude ade. Ta Aday tana erzanni fana taanin ta Adaya erane. Yinnii fana, taanii ta duruntsana erane; ta duruntsin tana erane. Taanii ta duruntsi gisho ta shemppito aatsii inggane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Maato. 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luqa. 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Hyanna kaltte baayze melle duruntsi taas yene. Ta unttana ko7odes beezane. Un ta qaaltto si7oda; un fettii wude maaqqada; yenggizayin fetto.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>«Taanii ta shemppito aatsii inggi mahi ekkize gisho ta Aday tana kadhane. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Ta qofar ta shemppito aatsii ingganep attin taappa ooden ekkoos. Ta ta shemppito aatsii inggodesin mahi ekkodes adetits wolqqa taas yene. Ta oochchode gaar ta Aday tana kiittezanna hyanno» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Yinna E gayde qaaltti gisho Ayhuduntsi gidda mahi dummatitsi medhinttida. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Unttappa gaamuntsi, «E gidda tuna ayyaana yene! E zhaashitane! E gaazanno akkos si7e?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Melluntsi mahi, «Xalahe aykkide asi ohinttize fana baaya. Xalahe qooqe aafe bugodes dandda7anene?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa As Na7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Yerusalaame Xoozze Keetsito geeshide qammito bonchchize ba7ale yellida; sa7ita barggo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesuusa Xoozze Keetstsa Solomone furtstsara goden hyankka hyanttane. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Ayhuduntsi Yesuusa kale eqqii, «Ne nuna ayde yellodes so7era gam7isade? Ne Kiristtoosa maaqqiko ane nuus geeshi oho» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesuusa mahi unttago, «Ta yinttis ohida; yezin tana ammananxida. Taanii ta Aday suntsite oochchize oochita ta baz markkidhane. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohidanni gaara yin ta duro maaqqikaayze gisho ammananxida. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ta duruntsi ta qaaltto si7ine. Ta unttana erane; unttin tana kaallane. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Ta unttis medhina de7o inggane; un mulon dhaboos. Ooden ta kushtippa unttana bonqoos. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Unttana taas inggide ta Aday ubbappa aadhane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ta Aday ubbappa aadhane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii zaga maxaafuntsi, «Ta Aday taas inggide un ubbappa aadhane» yagayda. </char></note> Ooden ta Aday kushtippa unttana bonqii ekkodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Taanin ta Adayin fetto» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ayhuduntsi Yesuusa dhogodes mahi shuchchi dentsida. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Taanii oochchode gaar ta Aday taas inggide gaama lo77o oochito yinttana oochchii beezida. Yentsesappa aaye gisho tana shuchchara dhogodes koye?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ayhuduntsi mahi, «Nu nena ne lo77o oochiti gisho shuchchar dhogodes koyoos. Yezin ne Xoozza cazhize gishon as maaqqitera ne nena Xooz mahize gisho» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Leewe 24:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yin higgite, ‹Ta, Yin xoozuntsana gayda› ga7i xaafinttika?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Maz. 82:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Geeshi Maxaafe medhinas laaminttoos. Xoozii fa qaaltto inggide asuntsana, ‹xoozuntsana› ga7i xeegiko, <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Aday doorii anjjii hyanna alamite kiittide tana ‹Xoozze Na7a› gayde gisho wayzi ‹Xooz cazhane› yaga7e? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Taanii ta Aday oochchizanno oochanxiko tana ammanippete. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Yezin taanii oochchiza maaqqiko yin tana ammananxikon, ta Aday ta gidda yezannon taanin ta Aday gidda yezanno yin erode gaar qoppode gaar ta oochito ammanote» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Yikke mahi un eza aykkodes koyda, yezin E un kushtippa kezida.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Wahannisa tiino xammaqize besite, Yorddaanosa borkkappa seko fintsa Yesuusa fiinggi yeyga yezida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Waha. 1:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Gaama asuntsi Yesuusago yi7i, «Wahannisa melle atto yezin fettii kille bazin oochchikaaya, yezin E hyay atstsebaz ohidanna ubba turo» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Ize gaama asuntsi Yesuusa ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Alaazare hyayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Bitaaniya guta Alaazare gaaze fettii asi hyargginttida. Bitaaniya Mayramiran I mishta Martta yeze sa7a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:38-39">Luqa. 10:38-39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Mayrama Laatstse tohitilla shitto tizhii fa ommitira E tohito uccidanno. Hyargginttize I ishe Alaazare.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Waha. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Yinnii gisho, mishuntsi, «Laatstso, ne kadhize nu ishe hyargginttida» ga7i Yesuusago kiittida.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesuusa yinno si7ide wode «Hyanna hyarggita, Xoozze Na7ay bonchchitode gaaran Xoozze bonchchosp attin hyayqos yeltsize hyargge baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesuusa Marttan, I mishito Mayramon Alaazaren kadhane. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Yezin Alaazare hyargginttidanno Yesuusa si7i fa yeze besite lam77i qamma aqida. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Maaqqii Yihuda sa7a yedhdhote» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>E tamaaruntsi mahi, «Asttamaarizayo, eerats wodeppa tiino Ayhuduntsi nena shuchchar dhogii wodhodes koyda; hyatten ize hyanggodane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesuusa, «Fettii awa taphpho lam77i saate baane? Awarara yedhdhize asi hyanna alame foo7ito be7ize gisho dhubinttoos. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Yezin qamma yedhdhize ooden foo7o baayze gisho dhubinttane» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Yesuusa yinno gaydannippa maaqqii unttago, «Nu kadhize Alaazare genttida, yezin eza dentsodes ta hyammada» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>E tamaaruntsi mahi, «Laatstso, E genttezebaz maaqqiko denddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Yesuusa Alaazare hyayqqidanno ohida, yezin unttis cer gentto aazida. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa geeshi unttago, «Alaazare hyayqqida. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Yin ammanode fana ta yinna besite baayzanna yin gisho ufayssane. Ane yedhdhote; eego hyammada» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Didimoosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Didimoosa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaazanna mentte ga7e.</char></note> ga7inttize Toomaasa fa lagge tamaaruntsago, «Eera hyayqqodes nuusin yedhdhote» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa denddon de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesuusa yellize wode Alaazare mooginttin oyddii qamma maaqqida. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bitaaney Yerusalaameppa hyaydzdzii kilo mitire gaar hyaakkane. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Gaama Ayhudunts Marttan Mayramon un ishe hyayqqidannis mintsitsodes yi7ida.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Martta Yesuusa yi7idanno si7i eza mokkodes kezida, yezin Mayrama keetstsa attida. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Martta Yesuusago, «Laatstso, ne hyanne yeze baz maaqqizako ta ishe hyayqaamyeshsha. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Yezin hyatte maaqqikon ne woossize baz Xoozii nees inggodanno ta erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesuusa, «Ne ishe hyayqoppa denddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Martta eego, «Wurssutsi qamma E hyayqoppa denddodanno erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesuusa iigo, «Taanii denddon de7on; tana ammanze ooden hyayqikon de7o yessada. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Mahi de7o maaqqiden tana ammanze ooden medhinas hyayqqoos. Yinno ne ammanane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Martta mahi, «Laatstso, yee ta ammanane! Ne Xoozze Na7a, alame yo7odes yeze Kiristtoosa maaqqidanno ta ammanane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Martta yinno gaydannippa maaqqii, hyanggi fa mishto aachintti xeegii, «Asttamaarize yi7i nena xeegane» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mayrama yinno si7ide wode ellisii denddii eqqii Yesuusago hyanggida. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Ye wode Yesuusa Marttara yellinttide besite yene; hyaga kara gancce yellikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Mayramo mintsitsiter iira keetstsa yeze Ayhuduntsi, iza denddii eqqii ellisii bale kezidanno bi7i, booza hyanggi yeekkodes yi7iza aazin izo kaallii kezida.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mayrama Yesuusa yeze besito hyanggi eza bi7ide wode E tohitilla gol7i, «Laatstso, ne hyanne yeze baz maaqqezako ta ishe hyayqqaam yeshsha» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesuusa Mayramiran iira yeze, Ayhuduntsi yeekkizanno bi7i, fa wozintte gaama yiqsinttii, <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>«Aba moogido?» ga7i oocin, «Laatstso, yi7i bo7o» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesuusa afuxxida. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Yinnii gisho, Ayhuduntsi, «E Alaazare akko gaar kadhezako bo7ote» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Yezin unttappa fete fete, «Hyay qooqize aafto bugide hyay atstse hyayqqaame gaar yissades dandda7oso?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Alaazare hyayqoppa dentstsida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Mahi Yesuusa yiqsinttii, Alaazare mooginttide boozttigo hyanggida. Boozttan shuchchara keellinttide wom7o. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesuusa, «Shuchchito dentstsote» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Martta, «Laatstso, E hyayqqidannippa hyayno oyddii qamma maaqqide gisho hyatte zeeqqoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesuusa Marttago, «Ne ammanzebaz maaqqiko Xoozze bonchcho bo7odanno ta nees ohika?» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Un boozitilla yeze shuchchito dentsin Yesuusa salo ude bi7i, «Adayo, tana ne si7eze gisho nena galatane. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ne ubba wode tana si7izanno ta erane. Yezin hyanne eqqide asuntsi ne tana kiittezanno ammanode gaar ta un gisho hyanno gaane» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Yesuusa yinno gaydannippa maaqqii, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Alaazare, ude kezo!» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Hyayqqide atstse ziidhinttidannira kushitan tohito shalora acinttii yezin E aafta goozinttidannira boozttippa kezida. Yesuusa unttana, «Billote! Yedhdho ga7o!» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosalla zorinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Maato. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luqa. 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Yinnii gisho, Mayramigo yi7ide Ayhuduntsappa gaamuntsi Yesuusa oochchidanno bi7i eza ammanida. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Yezin unttappa fete fete Farisaawuntsago hyanggi Yesuusa oochchidanno unttis ohida. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, kahinunts hyalaquntsin Farisaawuntsi shanggos shiishii, «Hyay atstse gaama kille baz oochchize gisho nu akko oochcho? <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Nu eza cer ashshiko asi ubba eza ammanoda. Mahi Roome sa7a asuntsi yi7i nu Xoozze Keetsiton nu bagguntsana dhabsoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Unttappa fete Qayyaafa gaaze, yinna berite kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqide, «Yin akkon eroos! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Worzha ubba dhabodannippa fettii asi worzhiti gisho hyayqqodanna lo77o maaqqizanno erosa?» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>E yinno faappa gaykaaya. Yezin yinna berite kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqide gisho Yesuusa Ayhude asunts gisho hyayqqodes beezanno tinbbite ohida. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Mahi Yesuusa Ayhude asuntsi xalaalas maaqqikaayzin lalinttii yeze Xoozze as ubba fettilla shiishodesin fettii asi mahodes hyayqqoda.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Yinna qammitippa aykkii un eza wodhodes zorinttida. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa Ayhuduntsi gidda qoncce bessa hyanttikaaya. Yezin akko baayze sa7a kale yeze Efreeme guta qitida. Fa tamaaruntsara yinna besite gam7ida.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Ayhuduntsi bonchchize Faasiga qamma ukkida. Mahi gaama asuntsi fana geeshodes Faasiga bonchchize qamma yellodannippa tiino yinna sa7itippa Yerusalaame qitida. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Un Xoozze Keetstsa eqqii Yesuusa ye7ito naagize gisho «Akko qoppe? Yesuusa ba7ale bonchchodes ye7am yessane?» yaga7i fete feta oocida. <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Kahne hyalaquntsin Farisaawuntsi Yesuusa aykkodes, E yeze bestto erize ooden faas mallode fana kiittida.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa shitto tizhide maachito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Maato. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Faasiga bonchchize izipun qammappa tiino, Yesuusa hyayqoppa dentstside Alaazare yeze guta, Bitaaniya hyanggida. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Yinna besite un ees kawo giigizida. Alaazare Yesuusara wolla leematella bettezin Martta unttis kiitinttane. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Mayrama narddoosa gaaze gaama al77o geeshi shitto ki7i Yesuusa tohitilla gussida. Fa ommitira E tohito uccida; keetsite ubba shitto sawora tonkku gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luqa. 7:37-38</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Yezin Yesuusa tamaaruntsappa fete, Yesuusa aatsii inggodes yeze, Asqorootu Yihuda, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Hyanna shittita hyaydzdzii xeet dinaares bayzinttii, miishita dahuntsis ingginttosa?» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>E kayzo maaqqide gisho yinno gaydap attin dahas yiqsinttii gaykaaya. E bira aykkiza maaqqide gisho ubba wode iippa faas ekkane.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesuusa, «Iza faas yeze baz ta mooginttize qammas minjjide gisho izo ashshii ashshote. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Dahuntsi ubba wode yinttara yessada, yezin ta ubba wode yinttara yezoos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Mahe 15:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Ye wode gaama asuntsi Yesuusa Bitaaniya yezanno si7i ize yi7ida. Un Yesuusa xalaala maaqqikaayzin E hyayqoppa dentside Alaazaren be7ades yi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Yinnii gisho, kahinunts hyalaquntsi Alaazaren gujjii wodhodes zorinttida. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Akkos gayko, Alaazare baggara gaama Ayhuduntsi unttana ixxii Yesuusa ammanze gisho.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa bonchchora Yerusalaame gelida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Maato. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luqa. 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Wonttisti wode Faasiga bonchchize besite ye7ize gaama asuntsi Yesuusa Yerusalaame yi7izanno si7i, <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Qiile hyaye ekkii eza mokkodes kezida. Un fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Hosaana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">Laatstse suntsite ye7ize!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">Isra7eele Kaati anjjintto!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:13">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Maz. 118:25-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14-15"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:14-15">«Xiyoone katamite, zhashtippe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">Yikke, ne Kaatize hyare na7alla bettii yi7ida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:14-15">gaynttidanni fana Yesuusa hyare na7a denggi eza toggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakka. 9:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi yinno tiino tiirikaaya. Yezin Yesuusa bonchchinttidannippa suuba un yinno ubba tiirida. Yinna ubba Geeshi Maxaafta gaydannigaara hyanida.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Yesuusa Alaazare boozappa xeegii, hyayqoppa dentside wode eera yeze gaama asuntsi Yesuusa baz markkidhida. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Gaama asuntsi eza mokkodes kezide, E yinna kille bazito oochchezanno si7ide gisho. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Yinnii gisho, Farisaawuntsi fete fetego, «Nu akkon oochchodes dandda7oosanno bo7ote; worzhita ubba eza kaallida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Faasiga bonchchize wode goynodes Yerusalaame hyanggezunts gidda fettii fettii Girike asuntsi yene. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Unttin Galila sa7a Beetesayda katamappa yi7ide Filphoosago yi7i, «Laatstso, nuunii Yesuusa be7ades koyane» yaga7i woossida. <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filphoosa hyanggi Inddiriyases ohin lam77untsi hyanggi, Yesuusas ohida.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesuusa unttago, «As Na7ay, bonchchinttize wode yellida. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; fettii zarga aafe sa7a wodhdhii dolanxiko faas attane. Yezin ye zarga aafize doliko gaama aafe aafane. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Fa shemppito kadhize ooden dhabssane; fa shemppito hyanna alamite ixxize ooden medhina de7oos naagane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luqa. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Ta yeze besite taara yessade gaar taas oochchodes koyeze ooden tana kaallodes beezane. Taas oochchiza oonan ta Aday bonchchoda.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa hyayqitibaz tiinii ohida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>«Hyatte ta shemppita gaama un77inttida; yeezin waago? ‹Ta Adayo, tana hyanna saattippa ashsho› yagawune? Ade, ta yi7idanna hyanna madha saatis. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Ta Adayo, ne suntsito bonchcho» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ye wode saloppa, «Taanii ta suntsito bonchchida; mahin bonchchoda» yagaaze qaala yi7ida.<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Yinna besite eqqide gaama asuntsi yinna qaaltto si7i, «Yinna dada dhoge» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:29">Melluntsi mahi, «Kiitanchcho ees ohida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yesuusa mahi unttago, «Hyay ootsize yin gisho yi7idap attin ta gisho baaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Hyanna alamita firddinttize wodita hyatte; hyanna alamito ahize kaatize hyatte bale olinttoda. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Mahi ta sa7appa dhoqi dhoqi gayde wode as ubba taago ko7oda» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>E yinno gaydanna akko gaar hyayqo hyayqqodyezako unttis qonccissades.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Gaama asuntsi mahi, «Nu higgita Kiristtoosa medhina yezanno ohine. Yeezin, ne waaga7i, ‹As Na7ay dhoqi dhoqi gawudes beezane› ga7e? ‹E, As Na7ay oode?› » yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hiz. 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dane. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesuusa, «Foo7o yinttara eerats wode gam77oda. Yinttis dhumaame gaar foo7o yezin, foo7ite hyanttote. Dhuma yedhdhize asi ana qitizako eroos. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Foo7o na7untsana maaqqade gaar foo7o yezin foo7iza ammanote» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Ayhuduntsi ammanikaaya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesuusa yinno ohidannippa maaqqii hyanggi unttappa genggida. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>E yinnii fana kille baz un tiino oochchinin ammanikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Nabe Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Laatstso, nu markkatitsito oonii ammanide?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Laatstse fa wolqqito oos qonccizido?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:38">Gaydanna turo maaqqade fana un eza ammanikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39-40"/>Mahin Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:39-40">«un aafta be7aame gaar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">un wozintta tiiraame gaar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">un Xoozago maaqqin, E unttana fatstsaame gaar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">Xoozii un aafto qooqizida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">Un wozintta minggida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:39-40">gayde gisho un ammanodes dandda7ikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa. 6:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:39-40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isayaasa yinno gaydanna, Yesuusa bonchchito bi7ide gishone ebazin ohide gisho.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Maaqqikon, Ayhude hyalaquntsappa gaamuntsi Yesuusa ammanida. Yezin Farisaawuntsi fana Ayhuduntsi woosa keetstsappa kessoda ga7i zhashtide gisho ammanida ga7i qoncce markkidhikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Yinno un oochchide, Xoozze bonchchoppa aadhii as bonchcho kadhide gisho.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesuusa fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Tana ammanze ooden tana kiittezan ammananep attin tana xalaala ammanoos. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Tana be7ize ooden tana kiittezan be7ine. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Tana ammanze ubba dhuma yezaame fana ta foo7o maaqqii alame yi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Ta qaaltto si7i kiitinttoosa oonan ta firddoos. Akkos gayko, ta alamito ashshodes yi7idap attin firddodes yi7ikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Tana ixxizayan ta qaaltto ekkoossa oonan firddize yene. Ta ohide qaaltta wurssutsi qamma ye atstsa firddoda. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Akkos gayko, ta yinno taappa ohoos, yezin tana kiitteze ta Aday ta gawudannon ohodanno kiittida. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Mahi E kiittan medhina de7o maaqqidanno ta erane. Yinnii gisho, ta ohizanna ta Aday taas ohidanno» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa tamaarunts tohito meeccida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Faasiga bonchchize qammita yellodannippa tiino hyanna alamito ashshii Adego qitize wode yellidanno Yesuusa erane. Hyanna alamite yeze fa asuntsana ubba wode kadhane; wurssutsi yellodes unttana kadhane.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesuusaran E tamaaruntsara wolla kawo muune. Yinnippa tiino Xalahe Simoona na7a Asqorootu Yihuda Yesuusa aatsii inggodegaara E wozintte iita qofa gaddida. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesuusa Aday ubbabazito E kushite gaddidanno, E Xoozze kaleppa yi7idannon maaqqii eego uddodanno erane. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Yesuusa kawoppa denddii kattara yeze ma7ito qaarii gaddii, afula lodo ekkii fa qazintte danccida. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, hyaatsi gabate faqii, fa tamaaruntsi tohito meeccida; mahi fa qazintte danccide afula lodora uccida.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Yesuusa Simoon Phexiroosago yellide wode Phexiroosa, «Laatstso, ne ta tohito meeccodaane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesuusa mahi eego, «Ta oochchizanno ne hyatte eroos, yezin suubappa tiiroda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Yeezin, Phexiroosa, «Ne ta tohito medhinas meecaama» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesuusa eego, «Ta ne tohito meeccanxxiko neesin taas fettetitsi baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Phexiroosa Yesuusago, «Laatstso, yeezako, ta tohito xalaala maaqqikaayzin ta kushiton ta ommiton ubba meecco» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Galla mattinttide ooden toheppa mellebaz mattinttodes beezoos; ees ubba galtta geeshi. Yin geeshi, yezin ubbuntsi geeshi baaya» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesuusa fana aatsii immade atstse oona yezako erize gisho «Yin ubbuntsi geeshi baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Un tohito meeccidannippa maaqqii Yesuusa fa ma7ito mahi ma77ida. Maaqqii un gidda bettii unttago, «Taanii yinttis oochchidanno tiirane?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luqa. 22:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Yin tana asttamaaren Laatstsin gaane; taanii yin gaazanni fana maaqqide gisho lo77o gayda. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Ta yinttis Laatstsin asttamaare maaqqitera yin tohito meecciko yinttin fete fetes yinnii gaara oochchodes beezane. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Yikke, ta yinttis oochchidanni gaar yinttin oochchode gaar ta yinttis aazize inggida. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; aro fa laatstseppa, kiitinttizen kiittideppa aadhoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Maato. 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luqa. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Waha. 15:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Yin yinno erii oochchiza maaqqiko anjjinttiduntsana.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>«Ta yin ubbuntsana ga7oos; ta dooriduntsana ta erane. Yezin Geeshi Maxaafite, ‹Ta booriza muyde taalla denddida› ga7inttidanna turo maaqqades beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Taanii tana maaqqizanno yin ammanode gaar yinna hyanodannippa tiino yinttis ohine. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; ta kiittide atstsa mokkize tana mokkane. Tana mokkize ooden tana kiitteza mokkane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Maato. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luqa. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fana aatsii inggode oona yezako tiinii ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Maato. 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar. 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luqa. 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesuusa yinno ohidannippa maaqqii fa wozintte gaama un77intti, «Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; tana yinttappa fete aatsii inggoda» ga7i qonccizi ohida.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>E ohidanna tamaaruntsis erinttanxin wol bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>E tamaaruntsappa fete, Yesuusa kadhize, Yesuusa kale bettida. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Yinnii gisho, Simoon Phexiroosa eza mallii, «E oona gaazako ane ooco» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Yinnii gisho, ye tamaarize Yesuusago shiiqii, «Laatstso, E oode?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta boora baxxi tushii baarsizaya» yagayda. Mahin boora baxxi ekkii, tushii, Simoona na7ays Asqorootu Yihudas inggida. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yihuda booriza baaridannippa maaqqii Xalahe iira Yihuda gidda gelida. Yesuusa eego, «Ne oochchodes qoppezanno ellisii oochcho» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Yezin betteezuntsappa ooden Yesuusa yinno akkos eego ga7ezako erikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yihuda bira aykkize gisho eza tamaaruntsappa fete fete Yesuusa eza, «Faasiga bonchchize qammas faas beezize baz wonggo woy dahuntsi muxaate inggo gayda» yaga7i qoppida.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yihuda booriza ekkide fana iira bale kezida. Ye wode sa7ita qamma.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kille kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yihuda bale kezidannippa maaqqii, Yesuusa, «Hyatte As Na7ay bonchchinttida; Xoozin E baggara bonchchinttida. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Xoozii E baggara bonchchinttin E fa ommite As Na7aya bonchchoda; mahi E yinno ellisii yiissada. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Ta na7untso, ta yinttara gaama wode gam77oos. Yin tana koyoda, yezin ta Ayhuduntsis ohizanni gaar, ‹Yin taanii qitide bestto yo7odes dandda7oos.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Waha. 7:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Ta yinttis inggize kille kiitta hyanno; fete feta kadhote. Ta yinttana kadhidannifana yin fete feta kadhodes beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Waha. 15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Waha. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Waha. 5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Yin fete fetera kadhinttiko yin ta tamaaruntsana maaqqizanno asi ubba yinne eroda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa kaddodanno Yesuusa tiinii ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Maato. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luqa. 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simoon Phexiroosa Yesuusago, «Laatstso, ne aba qite?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesuusa mahi, «Ta qitize bessa ne hyatte kaallodes dandda7oos, yezin suubappa tana kaalloda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Phexiroosa, «Laatstso, ta nena hyatte kaallodes akkos dandda7osa? Ta ne gisho hyayqqodesin giigii bettida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta gisho hyayqqodes turo giigii bettida? Ta nees turo turo gaane; lukule uukkodannippa tiino ne tana hyaydzdzii tohe kaddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Adego kuddize oge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Yin wozintta yirggippe, Xoozza ammanote, tanan ammanote. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Ta Aday keetstsa gaama bessi yene. Ta yinttis bessi giigissades qitane. Yinna baayzako ta yinttis ohod yeshsha. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Ta uddii bessi giigizidannippa suuba ta yeze besite yin yessade gaar lam7intsa yi7i yinttana taago ekkoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Yin ta qitize besiton ogito erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Yeezin, Toomaasa, «Laatstso, ne qitize bestto nu eroos; ogito wayzi erodes dandda7ode?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Oge, turon de7on tana. Ta baggara maaqqanxiko ooden ta Adego yo7odes dandda7oos. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Yin tana erizako, ta Adayan eroda. Yezin yikkeppa aykkii yin eza eranen eza bi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filphoosan Yesuusago, «Laatstso, Adaya nuna beezzako; nuus maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesuusan mahi, «Ta hyannii gaarize wode yinttara yezin tana erosite? Tana bi7ide atstse Adayan bi7ida. Yeezin, ne wayzi, ‹Adaya nuna beezo› ga7e? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Taanii Adera fetto maaqqidannon Aden taara fetto maaqqidanno ne ammanosane? Ta yinttis ohize qaaltto ta taappa ohoos, yezin ta gidda yeze Aday E fa oochito oochchane. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Taanii Aday gidda yezannon Aden ta gidda yezanno ammanote. Yinno ammananxiko ta oochite tana ammanote.<verse eid="JHN 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>«Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; tana ammanze atstse ta oochchize oocha E oochchoda. Ta Adego qitize gisho tana ammanze ooden hyannippa aadhize oocha oochchoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Aday Na7ay baggara bonchchinttode fana ta suntsite yin woossize baz ubba ta yinttis yiissada. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Ta suntsite akko bazin yin oociko ta yinttis oochchoda.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Geeshi Ayyaana inggodes qaala gelida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Yin tana kadhiko ta kiitto naagote. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Taanii ta Adaya woossoda; yinttara medhina yessade gaar mintsitsiza yinttis inggoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Ye Ayyaanize Xoozze turo beezane. Hyanna alamite asuntsi eza bi7ikaayze gishon eroosse gisho eza ekkodes dandda7oos. Yezin E yinttara yeze gishon yin gidda yessade gisho yin eza erane.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>«Ta yinttana inddan aden baayze na7a gaar yin xalaala ashshoos; maaqqii yinttago yo7oda. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Eeratsi wodeppa suuba alame tana mahi bo7oos, yezin yin bo7oda. Ta de7o maaqqide gisho yinttin de7o yessada. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Ta ta Aday gidda, yin ta gidda, mahi ta yinttara yezanno yin ye wode eroda.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>«Ta kiitto ekkii naagize tana kadhane. Tana kadhizaya ta Aden kadhane; taanin eza kadhane; taanin tanatitsito yinttis qonccisada» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Asqorootu Yihuda maaqqikaayze Yihuda Yesuusago, «Laatstso, ne wayzi alames maaqqikaayzin nuus nena qonccissade?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Tana kadhize ooden ta qaaltto naagoda. Ta Aday eza kadhoda. Eego nu yo7oda. Eera yessada. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Tana kadhoosse ooden ta qaaltto naagoos. Yin si7ize qaaltta tana kiittide Ade bazep attin ta baz baaya.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«Ta yinttara hyatte yeze gisho yinno yinttis ohida. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Yezin Aday ta suntsite kiittize mintsitsize Geeshi Ayyaana, yinttana ubbabazito tamaarssoda. Ta yinttis ohidanno ubba E yinttana qofissada.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>«Saro yinttis ashshoda. Taanii ta sarito yinttis inggoda. Ta inggize sarotitsita alame inggize sarotitsiti fana baaya. Yinnii gisho, yin wozintta yirggippen, zhashtippe. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>‹Ta qitoda, yezin maaqqii yinttago yo7oda› gaydanno yin si7ida. Yin tana turo kadhizebaz maaqqiko ta Aday taappa aadhize gisho ta eego qitizanne yin ufayttoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Yinna yiize wode yin ammanode gaar yinna hyanikaayzin tiino ta yinttis ohida.<verse eid="JHN 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>«Hyanna alamito ahize ye7ize gisho yikkeppa suuba yinttara gaama ohinttoos. Tana E akkon oochchodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Yezin ta Adaya kadhizanno alame erode gaar ta Aday tana kiittezanno ubba yiissada. Denddote; hyannippa yedhdhote.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Woynes turii uzuma Yesuusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>«Ta woynes turii uzuma, wootizen ta Adaya. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Ta gidda yeze aafe aafoosse tashito ubba E gachchii hyaasoda. Aafize tashito kasennippa gaantsi aafode fana yinna tashito E koshii giigissada. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Ta yinttis ohide qaaltti gisho yin geeshi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ta gidda yezote; taanin yin gidda yessada. Woynes tashe uzumzella yezanxiko ye tashize fa faas aafe aafodes dandda7oos. Yinnii fana, yinttin ta gidda yezanxiko aafe aafodes dandda7oos.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«Taanii woynes uzuma; yin tashe. Taalla yezen taanin E gidda yeze, E gaama aafe aafoda. Ta baayzin yin xalaala akkon oochchodes dandda7oos.<figure style="fig" alt="Grape vine on trellis" file="HK00112B.TIF" size="span" ref="15:5">Woynes uzuman zhanggen </figure> <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Taalla yezoosse tashe fana alla olintti meloda. Yinnii fana tashuntsan shiishii tama oloda, michchoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Yin taar yeziko, ta qaalttan yinggida yeziko, yin koyze baz akko maaqqikon woossote; yin ekkoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Yin gaama aafe aafize ta tamaaruntsana maaqqiko, yinne ta Aday bonchchinttoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Aday tana kadhizanni gaara taanin yinttana kadhane; ta siiqite yezote. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Taanii ta Aday kiitto naagii E siiqite yezidannigaara yinttin ta kiitto naagiko ta siiqite yessada.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>«Ta ufayssita yinggida folinttode fanan yin ufayssita folo maaqqade fana ta yinttis yinno ohida. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ta kiitta hyanno; ta yinttana kadhizanni fana yinttin fete feta kadhote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Waha. 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Waha. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:5">Yihu. 5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Fa shemppito fa lagguntsis inggizannippa aadhize damma siiqo baaya. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Ta yinttana kiittidanno ubba oochchiko yin ta lagguntsana.<verse eid="JHN 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>«Aro fa laatstsay oochchizebaz eroosse gisho ta yinttana yikkeppa maaqqii aruntsana ga7oos. Yezin ta Adaya si7ize ubba ta yinttis ohide gisho yinttana ta lagguntsana gayda. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Ta yinttana dooridap attin yin tana doorikaaya. Yin hyanggi aafe aafode fanan aafera yin yessade fana shuumida. Yinno maaqqiko ta Aday yin ta suntsitira woossidebaz ubba inggoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Ta kiitta hyanno: fete feta kadhote.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa alame ixxodanno ohida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Alame yinttana ixxiko tiino tana ixxidanno erote. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Yin alamebaz maaqqizako alame fa baz fana yinttana kadhodyeshsha. Yezin ta yinttana alameppa dooride gishon yin alamebaz maaqqikaayze gisho alame yinttana ixxane. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>‹Aro fa laatstseppa aadhoos› ga7i ta yinttis ohidanno qoppote. Un tana bay7izebaz maaqqiko yinttanan bay7oda. Un ta qaaltto naagezebaz maaqqiko yin qaaltton naagoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Maato. 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luqa. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Waha. 13:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Yezin un tana kiittezaya eroosse gisho hyanno ubba ta gisho yinttalla oochchoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ta yi7i ohikaayzako unttis nagara maaqqamyeshsha. Yezin hyatte un oochchide nagarttis miknaate baaya. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Tana ixxize ta Adayan ixxane. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Ooden oochchikaayze oocha ta un gidda oochchii bi7ikaayze baz maaqqizako unttis nagara maaqqamyeshsha. Yezin hyatte un ta oochchide oochchito bi7i tanan ta Adayan ixxida. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Yezin un higgite, ‹Tana hyarii ixxida› ga7intti xaafinttidanna folinttode fana yinna yii7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Maz. 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>«Adeppa ye7ize turii Ayyaana ta yinttis kiittoda. E yinttana mintsitsoda, ta baz markkidhoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Yinttin tiinoppa aykkii taara yeze gisho ta baz markkidhoda.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>«Ta yinno yin ammanttippa dhubinttaame fana yinttis ohida. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Un yinttana Ayhude woosa Keetstsappa kessoda. Yinnippan aadhii, yinttana wodhize ooden Xoozii koyze baz oochchiza aazize wode ye7oda. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Un yinno yinttalla oochchize tana woy Adaya erikaayze gisho. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Yezin un yinno yinttalla oochchize wodita yellide wode ta yinttis ohidanno yin qoppode gaar ta yinttis hyanno ohida.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Geeshi Ayyaana oocha</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Tiino ta hyanno yinttis ohikaayzara gam7idanna ta yinttara yeze gisho. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Yezin hyatte taanii tana kiittezego qitane; yinttappa ooden, ‹Aba qite?› ga7i tana oocize baaya. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Yezin ta yinno ohide gisho yin wozintte gaama kayo qofara kumida. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Yezin ta yinttis turo ohine; ta qitizako yinttis lo77o. Akkos gayko, ta qitanxiko mintsitsize yinttago ye7aama. Yezin ta qitiko eza yinttago dakkoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Mintsitsize yi7i, nagaras, xillotitsisin firddas hyanna alame asuntsana oocoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Nagaras, asuntsi tana ammanoose gisho. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Xillotitsis, ta Adego qitize gishon yin tana mahi be7aame gisho. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Firddas, mahi alamito ahize firddinttide gisho.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Ta yinttis ohode gaama baz yene, yezin hyatte yinttana deexxoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Turii Ayyaana yi7ide wode yinttana turetits ubbago kaalitsoda. E si7idebaz ohodap attin faappa akko bazin ohoos. Mahi tiinoppa ye7odebaz yinttis E ohoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>E taas yezannippa ekkii yinttis ohize gisho E tana bonchchoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Ades yeze baz ubbanna ta baz; ‹Mintsitsize taas yezannippa ekkii yinttis ohoda› ta gaydanna yinnisi.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yin azzantta ufayssa laaminttoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Eerats wodeppa suuba tana yin be7aama; mahi eerats wodeppa suuba yin tana bo7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>E tamaaruntsappa fete fete wol gidda, «‹Eerats wodeppa suuba yin tana be7aama; mahi eerats wodeppa suuba yin tana bo7oda›; mahin ta Adego qitoda gaazanna akko ga7intte?» ga7i wolla ohinttida. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Yikke «Eerats wodeppa suuba gaazanna akko ga7e? E akko ohizako nuus erinttoos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Un eza oocodes koyzanno Yesuusa erii, «Taanii, ‹Eerats wodeppa suuba tana be7aama; mahi eerats wodeppa suuba yin tana bo7oda› gaydannis yin fete feta oocane? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Taanii yinttis turo turo gaane; yin yeekkodan zeleloda, yezin hyanna alamita ufayttoda. Hyatte yin azzanoda, yezin yin azzantta ufayssa laaminttoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Fettii maachita na7a yelodes yii7ize wode fa yelize wodita yellide gisho yirgane. Yezin na7a yelidannippa suuba na7a hyanna alamite yelinttide ufaysiti gisho fa un7ito botane. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Yinnii gaar, yinttin yin wozintte azzanane, yezin taanii yinttana mahi bo7oda. Yin wozintta gaama ufayttoda; yinna ufaysito ooden yinttappa ekkoos.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>«Ye wode yin tana akko bazin woossaama. Ta yinttis turo turo gaane; yin ta suntsite woossize baz ubba Aday yinttis inggoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Hyanno yellodes ta suntsite akko bazin woossikaaya. Yin ufayssita folo maaqqade gaar woossote; yin ekkoda.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Taanii hyanno yellodes yinttis aazizera ohida, yikkeppa taanii aazizera ohoose wode ye7oda. Yezin Adebaz ta yinttis qonccizi ohoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Ye wode yin ta suntsite Adaya woossoda; yin gisho taanii ta Adaya woossoda ga7e baaya. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Akkos gayko, Aday fa ommite yinttana kadhane. Yin tana kadhize gishon ta Aday kaleppa yiidanno ammanze gisho E yinttana kadhane. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Ta Aday kaleppa hyanna alamite yiida; mahi alamito ashshii Adego qitoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>E tamaaruntsi mahi, «Yikke, hyatte neenii qonccizi ohinep attin; aazizera akkon ohoos. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Ne ubba baz erizanno oonan oocodes koyosanno nu hyatte erane. Yinnii gisho ne Xoozappa kiitinttidanna ammantsane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yeezin, Yesuusa mahi unttago, «Hyatte yin ammanane? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Yikke, yin, yin kara yin kara lalinttii tana ta xalaala ashshii ashshii aachinttode wode ye7oda; hyatten yellida. Yezin Aday taara yeze gisho ta ta xalaala baaya. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Yin taara yezin saro yinttis yessade fana ta yinno ohida. Alame gidda yeziter yin waayinttoda. Yezin minggote; taanii alamito gamida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesuusa yinno ohidannippa suuba ude salo bi7i, hyannigaara yagayda: «Ta Adayo, qammita yellida; ne Na7ay nena bonchchode gaar neenii ne Na7aya bonchcho. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Ne ees inggide ubbuntsis E medhina de7o inggode fana as ubballa ees adetits wolqqa inggida. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Medhina de7o, nena, fettii turii Xoozzan ne kiittide Yesuus Kiristtoosa ere. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Ne ta oochchode fana inggide oochito faaddii nena sa7alla bonchchida. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Hyatten, Adayo, alame medhinttodannippa tiino ne kale taas yeze bonchchite tana bonchcho.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>«Alame asappa ne taas inggiduntsana nena erisida. Un nebaz; ne unttana taas inggida. Un ne qaalttisin kiitinttida. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Ne taas inggide ubba bazita neeppa yiidanno un hyatte erane. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Ne taas inggide qaaltto ta unttis inggida; unttin yinna qaaltto ekkida. Ta ne kaleppa yi7idanna turo maaqqidanno erii ne tana kiittidanno ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>«Ta unttis woossane. Un nebaz maaqqide gisho ne taas inggide asuntsis woossanep attin alames woossoos. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Taas yezanna ubba nebaz; nees yezanna ubba taas. Ta un baggara bonchchinttida. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Ta yikkeppa suuba alamite gam7oos; un alamite yene. Ta hyatte neego qitane. Geeshi Adayo, hyantses ne taas inggiduntsi neeran taaran fetto maaqqidanni gaara un fetto maaqqade gaar unttana ne taas inggide ne suntsite naago. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Ta unttara sa7a yezitera, ne taas inggide ne suntsite unttana naagida. Geeshi Maxaafita gaydanna folinttode gaar dhabe beezze atstsep attin unttappa melle ooden dhabikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Waha. 13:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>«Hyatte ta neego ye7oda. Ta ufayssita un wozintte folo maaqqade gaar hyanno ta alamite yezara ohine. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Ta unttis ne qaaltto inggida. Ta alameppa maaqqikaayzanni fana, unttin alameppa maaqqikaayze gisho alame unttana ixxida. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Ne iitappa unttana naagode gaarap attin alameppa kessoda gaar woossoos. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Taanii alameppa baayzanni fana unttin alameppa baaya. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Neenii ne turite unttana geesho; ne qaalttan turo. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Ne tana alame kiittidanni fana taanin unttana alame kiittida. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Mahi un turo geeshi maaqqade gaar un gisho ta ta ommito geeshoda.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Taanii un xalaalas maaqqikaayzin un qaalttippa denddii, tana ammanoduntsisin woossane. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Un ubbuntsi fetto maaqqade gaar ta woossane. Adayo, ne ta gidda yezannigaara, mahi ta ne gidda yezannigaara un ne gidda yessade gaar woossane. Ye wode ne tana kiittezanno alame ammanoda. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Neenin taanin fetto maaqqidanni gaara, unttin fetto maaqqade gaar, ne tana bonchchidanni gaara, taanin unttana bonchchida. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Ta un gidda, neenii ta gidda yezannigaara un folo fetto maaqqade gaar nena woossane. Yinnan, ne tana kiittezanno ne tana kadhide kadhite un kadhidanno alame erode gaar.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«Adayo, ne taas inggiduntsi ta yeze besite taara yessade gaar koyane. Alame medhinttodannippa tiino ne tana kadhide gisho taas inggide ta bonchchito un bo7oda.<verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>«Geeshi ta Adayo, alame nena eroos, yezin nena ta erane. Mahi ne tana kiittezanno hyantses erane. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Ne tana siiqide siiqita un gidda yessade gaar, mahi taanii un gidda yessade gaar, ta ne suntsito unttana erisida; tiinosin erisoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa aykintte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Maato. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luqa. 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesuusa woosa hyaasidannippa maaqqii fa tamaaruntsara Qediroone borkka fiinggi, yinna besite yeze atakiltte gidda gelida. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yesuusa ubba wode fa tamaaruntsara ize shiiqize gisho Yesuusa aatsii inggide Yihuda yinna bessito erane. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Yinnii gisho, Yihuda faanoose, xomppe, ola miishe aykkide gaama wottaddaruntsana, kahinunts hyalaquntsin Farisaawuntsi kiittide Xoozze Keetsito naagize poolisuntsana kaalitsi ekkii, yinna bessito hyanggida.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesuusa fana yellode baz ubba erii, gaxa kezii, «Oona koyete?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Un mahi, «Naazirete Yesuusa koyane» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">E mahi, «Taanii Yesuusa» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesuusa aatsii inggide Yihuda ize unttara eqqida. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>E, «Taanii Yesuusa» gayde wode un suub shiiqii, sa7a gol7ida. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Oona koyete?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Unttin, «Naazirete Yesuusa koyane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>E mahi, «Taanii Yesuusa maaqqizanno yinttis ohida. Yikke, yin tana koyze baz maaqqiko hyantses qito ga7o ashshote» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>E yinno gayde, «Adayo, ne taas inggiduntsappa melle atto yezin fetan dhabsikaaya» gayde qaaltta folinttode fana.<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simoon Phexiroosas mashsha yene. E ye mashshiza shoddii kahinunts hyalaqa arizes mizaqi hyayza gachchii olida. Ye arize suntsita Malkkoosa. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesuusa Phexiroosago, «Ne mashshiza shookite geltso. Ta Aday taas inggide xuu7itippa ta uzhamaane?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Maato. 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar. 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luqa. 22:42</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Haanna tiino shiiqida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Maato. 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luqa. 22:54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Roome wottaddaruntsin un hyalaqize Xoozze Keetsito naagize poolisuntsara wolla Yesuusa aykkii accida. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Tiino Yesuusa Haannago kanggida. Haanna yinna berite kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqide Qayyaafa bolle. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Qayyaafa, «Worzha gisho fettii asi hyayqqiko lo77o» ga7i tiino Ayhuduntsana zoridaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">Waha. 11:49-50</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa Yesuusa kaddida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Maato. 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar. 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luqa. 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simoon Phexiroosan melle fettii tamaarize Yesuusa kaallii hyanggida. Kahine hyalaqize ye melle tamaariza loytsii erane. Yinnii gisho, E Yesuusara kahinunts hyalaqize gibbe gelida. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Yezin Phexiroosa gaseppa balera eqqida. Kahinunts hyalaqize erize melle tamaarize bale kezii, furtsito naagize naatis ohi, Phexiroosa geltsida. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Furtsito naagize naata Phexiroosago, «Ne, ye atstse tamaaruntsappa feta baane?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Phexiroosa mahi, «Aday, tana baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Sa7ita ciishize gisho aruntsin naagizuntsin kenchchelo qaaqa tama eetsii, wutii aadhii eqqii kaazhane. Phexiroosan unttara eqqii tama kaazhane.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kahinunts Hyalaqize Yesuusa oocida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Maato. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luqa. 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Ye wode Kahinunts hyalaqize Yesuusa, E tamaarunts bazin E timirttitibaz oocida. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta asi ubbas qonccizi ohida. Ta Ayhude ubbuntsis shiiqize Ayhude woosa Keetstsan Xoozze Keetstsa ubba wode tamaarssida. Aachchii akkon ohikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Yeezin, ne tana akkos ooce? Ta ohodera si7ide asuntsana ooco. Yentsi asuntsi ta ohidanno erane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesuusa yinno ohize wode yinna besite eqqide zabe naagizuntsappa fete Yesuusa baqqii, «Kahinunts hyalaqago yaga7i mahine?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta iita baz ohidebaz maaqqiko hyanne yeze as ubba tiino markkidho. Yezin ta turo ohidebaz maaqqiko tana akkos baqqe?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Yinnii gisho, Haanna, Yesuusa acinttii yezin kahinunts hyalaqize Qayyaafago dakkida.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa Yesuusa mahi kaddida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Maato. 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar. 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luqa. 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Phexiroosa ize eqqii, tama kaashadera, hyankkunts eego, «Ne hyay atstse tamaaruntsappa feta baane?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Phexiroosa mahi, «Ade, tana baaya» yaga7i kaddida.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Kahinunts hyalaqize aruntsappa fete, Phexiroosa hyaye gachchide atstses iginze, Phexiroosago, «Ta nena eera atakiltte gidda bi7ika?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Phexiroosa mahin kaddida. Iira lukule uukkida.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maato. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luqa. 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Wontta gooda, un Yesuusa Qayyaafa karappa Roome gade ahize oocha keetstsa kanggida. Ayhuduntsi Faasiga Ba7ale katstsa ma7ades fana tunizaame gaar kaatize oocha keetstsa gelikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Yinnii gisho, Philaaxoosa unttago bale kezii, «Hyay atstsa akkos moote?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Un, «E iita oochchosako nuunii eza neego ke7aama yeshsha» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Philaaxoosa mahi, «Yin eza ekkii kanggi, yin higgita gaazanni gaara eella firddote» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayhudunts, «Oodellan hyayqo firdda firddize adetits wolqqa nuus baaya» yagayda; <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Yinna yi7idanna Yesuusa akko gaar hyayqo hyayqqod yezako erisodes ohidanna folinttodes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Waha. 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Philaaxoosa fa oocha keetstsa mahi gelii, Yesuusa xeegii, «Ne Ayhude kaato?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesuusa Philaaxoosago, «Hyanna oocito ne neeppa oocanene woy melle asi nees ta baz ohida?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Philaaxoosa mahi, «Ta Ayhude aso? Ne asuntsin kahinunts hyalaquntsi nena taas aatsii inggida. Ne akko oochchido?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesuusa, «Ta ka7itumtta hyanna alamttippa baaya. Hyannippa maaqqizako ta Ayhudunts hyalaquntsis aadhii ingginttaame fana taas oochchizuntsi olinttodyeshsha. Yezin ta ka7itumtta hyanna alamttippa baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Yinnii gisho, Philaaxoosa Yesuusago, «Yeezin, ne kaat baa?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesuusa mahi, «Ta kaati maaqqidanno ne gayda. Taanii yelinttidannan hyanna alamite yi7idanna turetitsis markkidhades. Turippa maaqqide ooden ta gaazanno si7ine» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Philaaxoosa, «Turii akko?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Philaaxoosa yinno gaydannippa maaqqii Ayhuduntsago bale kezii, «Taanii eza mootize bala denggikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Yezin Faasiga Ba7ale ode, fettii asi yinttis achchappa billize woga yene. Ta yinttis Ayhuduntsi kaatiza billode gaar koyane?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Un mahi, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Barbbaana billop attin eza billippe» yagayda. Yezin Barbbaane faanno.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Wottaddaruntsi Yesuusa leqqida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Maato. 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar. 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Philaaxoosa Yesuusa kanggi garafizida. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Wottaddaruntsi anggats barneexa medhdhii E ommite gaddida. Mahi zoqo ma7o eza ma7isida. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Eego yi7itera, «Ayhude kaatizayo, saro nees maaqqe» yaga7i eza baqqida.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Philaaxoosa mahi bale kezii, Ayhuduntsago, «Yikke, taanii eeppa akko iitabazin denggikaayzanno yin erode gaar eza yinttago bale kessoda» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Yesuusa anggats barneexa fa ommite gaddii, zoqo ma7o ma77i, bale kezida. Philaaxoosa Ayhuduntsago, «Atstsa hyaya bo7ote» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Kahinunts hyalaquntsin Xoozze Keetsito naagizuntsi eza bi7ide wode fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Masqalalla suxxo! Suxxo!» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Philaaxoosa unttago, «Yin eza kanggi, masqalalla suxxo. Ta eeppa akko iitabazin denggikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ayhuduntsi mahi, «Nuus higge yene. E fana Xoozze na7a mahide gisho nu higgiti gaara E hyayqqodes beezane» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Philaaxoosa yinno si7ide wode tiinonnippa gaama zhashtida. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Mahin Philaaxoosa fa oocha keetstsite maaqqii gelii Yesuusago, «Ne abappa yi7ido?» yaga7i oocida. Yezin Yesuusa ees akkon mahikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Yinnii gisho, Philaaxoosa, «Taas ohoso? Nena billodes woy masqalalla suxxodes taas adetits wolqqa yezanno eroso?» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesuusa, «Xoozii nees adetits wolqqa inggikaayzako taalla adetits wolqqa nees yezamayeshsha. Yinnii gisho, tana nees aatsii inggide aadhize nagara oochchida» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusalla hyayqo firddida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Maato. 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar. 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luqa. 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Philaaxoosa yinno si7eze wode Yesuusa billodes oge koyda. Yezin Ayhuduntsi fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Ne eza billizebaz maaqqiko Kaat Qeesare ne bagga baaya. Fana kaati gaaze ooden Qeesare ixxizaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Philaaxoosa yinno si7i Yesuusa bale kessida. Yeyzi, «Lochche Shuchchi» gaaze bessa firdda oydalla bettida. Ibraysxe qaalara yinna bessita «Gebeta» ga7inttane. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Yinna qammita Faasiga Ba7aale bonchchodes giigize wode. Ye wode sa7itan awarappa izipun saate gaar. Philaaxoosa Ayhuduntsago, «Yin kaat hyaya bo7ote» gayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Ayhuduntsi fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Hyaaso! Hyaaso! Masqalalla suxxo» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Philaaxoosa mahi, «Yin kaatiza ta masqalalla suxxodanno koyane?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Kahinunts hyalaquntsi, «Qeesareppa melle kaati nuus baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, un Yesuusa masqalalla suxxode fana Philaaxoosa unttis aatsii inggida.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesuusa suxintte</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Maato. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luqa. 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Un Yesuusa aykkii kanggida. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yesuusa fa masqaliza tookkii, «Yeras qil» gaaze bessa kezida. «Yeras qil» ga7inttizanna Ibraysxe qaalara «Golggotta» ga7inttane. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on the cross" file="LB00324B.TIF" size="span" ref="19:17">Yesuusa masqalalla </figure> <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Un yinna besite masqalalla Yesuusa suxxida. Mahin eera melle lam77i asuntsana, feta seko zalara hyankkaya hyankka zalara masqalalla suxxida. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Philaaxoosa, «Ayhuduntsi Kaati, Naazirete Yesuusa» yagaaze xuufe xaafii masqalalla gaddida. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yesuusa masqalalla suxunttide besita katamas kale yeze gisho gaama Ayhuduntsi yinna xuufito nabbabida. Xuufize xaafinttidanna Ibraysxe doonara, Laatine doonaran Girike doonara. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Yinnii gisho, kahinunts hyalaquntsi Philaaxoosago, « ‹Hyay atstse fana Ayhude kaati gaydanni gaar› ga7i xaafop attin eza E ommite ‹Ayhude kaati› ga7i xaafippe yagayda.»<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Yeezin, Philaaxoosa, «Taanii xaafidanno xaafida» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Wottaddaruntsi masqalalla eza suxxidannippa suuba E ma7ito ekkii, oyddii bessa shaakkii, fetto fetto ekkida. Dakitsi ma7inttize pharggo ma7o yeshsha. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Wottaddaruntsi, «Oona yellodyezako, ixa olidap attin ma7iza fer7oos» yagayda. Yinna hyanidanna Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Ta ma7ito gizhintti ekkida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ta pharggo ma7izella ixa olida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">gaynttidanna folinttode gaar.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref></char></note>Yinnii gisho, wottaddaruntsi yinno yiizida.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Yezin Yesuusa masqala kale E inttan, E inttii mishta, Qeliyoopha machchita Mayramiran Magdela Mayrama eqqida. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesuusa fa intton E kadhize tamaarize ize eqqiduntsana bi7i, fa inttigo, «Ta intte, ne na7aya hyaya bo7o» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Yinnippa suuba, ye tamaarizego, «Ne intto hyanno bo7o» yagayda. Ye tamaarize izo yinna woditippa aykkii faara yessade gaar kara kanggida.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyayqo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Maato. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luqa. 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa ubbanna hyatte folinttidanno erii, Geeshi Maxaafite xaafinttidanna folinttode gaar «Tana barida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Yinna besite fettii gonbbo kumutsi caala woyne yene. Un fuza yinna woyntte dakkii, hisophe minxa bertstsa gaddii, Yesuusa doonago shiishida. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesuusa woyniza qamasi bi7i, «Folinttida» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Yinnippa suuba, fa ommito soxor yiizii fa shemppito inggida.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa millite toorara cadde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Yinna qammita giiginttize qamma maaqqide gishon wonttize qammize bonchcho Sambbata maaqqide gisho asuntsana ahita masqalalla Sambbata wode feezhaame gaar un bunqito mentsii, masqalappa ketstsode gaar Ayhuduntsi Philaaxoosa woossida. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Yinnii gisho, wottaddaruntsi hyanggi, Yesuusara suxunttide lam77i asuntsis bunqito mentsida. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Yezin Yesuusago yi7ide wode E hyayqqidanno bi7i, E bunqito mentsikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Yezin wottaddaruntsappa fete E millite toorara caddin iira suutsin hyaatsin goggida. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Yinno ammanode fana yinno bi7ide markkidhida. E markkatitsitan turo. Mahi E hyanidanna turo maaqqizanno erane. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Yinna hyanidanna Geeshi Maxaafite, «E meqatsitippa fettin meqqoos» gaydanna folinttode fana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Keze 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Faydo 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Maz. 34:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Mahin Geeshi Maxaafite melle bessa, «Un fa caddidanno bo7oda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakka. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Qon. 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa moogintte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Maato. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luqa. 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Yinnippa suuba, Armmatiyasa katamapa yi7ide Yoosefa Yesuusa ahito ekkodes Philaaxoosa woossida. Yoosefa Ayhuduntsis zhashtide gisho aachintti Yesuusa kaallizaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:38">Philaaxoosa, «Ekko» yagayda. Yinnii gisho, Yoosefa hyanggi Yesuusa ahito ekkida. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Mahi Niqodimoosa, hyannippa tiino Yesuusago qamma yi7iday, karbberan arkkintteran worqqinttide hyastam fettii kilo giiraame maaqqade shitto ekkii Yoosefara yi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Waha. 3:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Yentsi lam77i asuntsi Yesuusa ahito ekkii, Ayhuduntsi aha ziidhize wogara, shittora, moogize afulara xaaxida. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Yesuusa masqalalla suxunttide besite gaama atakiltte yene. Yinna atakilttiti gidda shuchchappa woocii giigizide hyaga ooden mooginttikaayze kille booza yene. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ye wom7ize kale yeze gishon Ayhuduntsi Sambbatas giiginttize wode maaqqide gisho Yesuusa ahito ize moogida.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyayqoppa dendde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Maato. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luqa. 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Wogga ode wontta hyaga sa7a geezhikaayzin, Magdela Mayrama, Yesuusa mooginttide booza hyanggi shuchchita booza doonttippa denddidanno bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Simoon Phexiroosagon Yesuusa kadhize hyankkay tamaarizego woxxii hyanggi, «Boozitippa Laatstsa ekkida; eza aba gaddezako nu eroos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Yinnii gisho, Phexiroosan hyankkay tamaarize kezii woxxittera booza hyanggida. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Lam77untsin fettilla woxxida, yezin hyankkay tamaarize Phexiroosappa aadhii tiino boozite yellida. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Ye tamaarize zuggii, eza xaaxide afultto bi7ida, yezin booziti gidda wodhdhikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simoon Phexiroosa eza kaallii yi7i, booziti gidda wodhdhii eza xaaxide afultta ize yezanno bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Mahi Yesuusa ommito xaaxide afula xaaxintti boozite omma guro yezin bi7ida. Ye afulize dumma bessa yenep attin booza afulara wolla baaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Ye wode tiinii booztte yellide hyankkay tamaarize gelii bi7i ammanida. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Yesuusa hyayqoppa denddodes beezanno ohize Geeshi maxaafe yeze qaaltto un hyaga tiirikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Yinnippa suuba, E tamaaruntsi fa kara maaqqii qitida.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Magdela Mayramis benttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Maato. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar. 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Yezin Mayrama yinna booziti doontte eqqii yeekkitera zuggii boozito bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Bootsi ma7o ma77ide lam77i kiitanchchuntsi Yesuusa ahita woy7ide besite fete omma gurora fete tohe guro bettezin bi7ida. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Un iigo, «Maachite, akkos yeekke?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Iza, «Un ta Laatstsa ekkida; un aba gaddezako ta eroos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Yinno gaydannippa suuba, iza suub maaqqii be7ize wode Yesuusa ize eqqezin bi7ida. Yezin E Yesuusa maaqqidanno erikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesuusa iigo, «Maachite, akkos yeekke? Oona koye?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Mayrama atakiltte oochchize asi aazin, «Laatstso, ne ekkezako, eza aba gaddezako taas ohoya. Ta eza ekkoda» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesuusa iigo, «Mayrame» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Iza eego maaqqin, Ibraysxe doonara «Rebuunii» yagayda. Bilitsitan «Asttamaarizayo» ga7e.<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesuusa iigo, «Ta hyaga ta Adego kezikaayze gisho tana aykkippe. Yezin ta ishuntsanan hyanggi, ‹Taanii ta Adegon yin Adego, ta Xoozzegon yin Xoozzego, kessada gayda› ga7i unttis oho» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Magdela Mayrama Laatstsa bi7idannon iis E ohidanno hyanggi E tamaaruntsis ohida.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsis benttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Maato. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luqa. 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Wogga ode ugure, E tamaaruntsi Ayhuduntsis zhashtii furtsito gorddii shiiqii bettezin, Yesuusa yi7i, un gidda eqqii, «Saro yinttis maaqqe» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Yinno ga7i maaqqii fa kushiton fa millito unttana beezida. E tamaaruntsi Laatstsa bi7ide wode gaama ufayttida. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesuusa mahi unttago, «Saro yinttis maaqqe; ta Aday tana kiittidannigaara taanin yinttana kiittoda» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Yinno ga7idannippa suuba, unttalla ufi ga7i fuggida. Mahi, «Geeshi Ayyaana ekkote. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Yin atto gayde as nagartta atto ga7inttoda. Yin atto gaykaayze nagartta atto gaynttoos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Maato. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Toomaasan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Yezin taphpho lam77i tamaaruntsappa fete, Didimoosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didimoosa gaazes bilitsita Waha 11:16 bo7ote.</char></note> ga7inttize Toomaasa, Yesuusa ye7ize wode unttara baaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Yinnii gisho, hyankko E tamaaruntsi Toomasago, «Nuunii Laatstsa bi7ida» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Yezin Toomaasa unttago, «Misimarera E cadinttide E kushite yeze beetto bi7ikaayzara yinna beetto ta gil7ara bochchikaayzara, mahi ta kushito E millite dakkii bi7ikaayzara ammanoos» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Osfun qammappa suuba, Yesuusa tamaaruntsi mahi keetstsa shiiqii bettida; Toomaasan unttara yeshsha. Furtsita gorddinttii yezin Yesuusa yi7i, un gidda eqqii, «Saro yinttis maaqqe» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa Toomasago, «Ta kushito ne gil7itira bochchii bo7o. Mahi ne kushito ta millite dakkii bo7o; so7ippe, ammano» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Toomaasa mahi, «Ta Laatstsayo, ta Xoozayo» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yeezin Yesuusa, «Ne tana bi7ide gisho ammanida, yezin bi7ikaayzara ammaniduntsii anjjinttiduntsana» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyay maxaafize qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesuusa maxaafite xaafinttikaayze melle gaama kille baz fa tamaarunts tiintte oochchida. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Yezin Yesuusa E Kiristtoosa, Xoozze Na7a maaqqizanno yin ammanode gaaran ammanii E suntsite de7o denggode gaar hyanna xaafinttida.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa laappun fa tamaaruntsis qonccida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa Xibaaryoosa Abba kale fa tamaaruntsis mahi qonccida. E unttis hyannippa kaallii yeze hyanotitsar qonccida. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simoon Phexiroosa, Didimoos ga7inttize Toomaasa, Qaana Galilappa yi7ide Natina7eela, Zabdoosa na7untsin Yesuusa tamaaruntsappa melle lam77unts wolla yene.<verse eid="JHN 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simoon Phexiroosa unttago, «Ta molo aykkodes qitane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luqa. 5:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Un, «Nuunin neera hyammada» yaga7i, gongge gidda gelida. Yezin un yinna qammite akko molon aykkikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Wontta gooda xalqe kessadannippa tiino, Yesuusa abba gaxa eqqida, yezin E tamaaruntsi Yesuusa maaqqidanno erikaaya. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Na7untso, akko muuze baz yene?» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Un mahi, «Akkon baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>E mahi, «Yin molo aykkize gitto gonggizeppa mizaqi zalara olote; molo yin aykkoda» yagayda. Yinnii gisho, molo aykkize gitto mizaqi zalara olida. Molo gelii kumide gisho gochchii kessodes gamida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luqa. 5:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Yesuusa kadhize tamaarize Phexiroosago, «Hyayni Laatstsi!» yagayda. Simoon Phexiroosa E Laatstsi maaqqidanno si7ide wode gaarii gaddide fa ma7ito ma77i abba gidda doollii gelida. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Yezin gonggite attide hyankko tamaaruntsi molo kumide gitto gochchii, abbappa gaxa kezida. Un abbappa lam77i xeet hyadha fana hyaakkida. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Un abbappa gaxa kezide wode kenchchelo tama qaaqa, molon booran bi7ida.<verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Hyatte yin aykkide molttippa ane taas ko7ote» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simoon Phexiroosa gonggite gelii, xeeti ichintam hyaydzdzii damma molo aykkide gitto gochchii abbappa gaxa kessida. Moltta yinnii gaar gaama maaqqikon molo aykkide gitto fer7ikaaya.<verse eid="JHN 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Hyankka yi7i dayxe mo7ote» yagayda. E Laatstsi maaqqidanno un eride gisho E tamaaruntsappa fettin, «Ne oode?» ga7i eza oocodes miinggide baaya. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesuusa yi7i, boora ekkii unttis inggida; moloppan yinnii gaara inggida.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yesuusa hyayqoppa denddii fa tamaaruntsis benttide hyannira hyaydzintsa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Phexiroosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Un dayxito mu7idannippa suuba, Yesuusa Simoon Phexiroosago, «Yoona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yoona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girike doonara Yoona gaaze suntsita Wahannisa gaaze suntsitis saqintse suntsi. </char></note> na7a Simoona, tana hyantsesappa aatsii kadhane?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Simoon Phexiroosa, «Yee Laatstso, ta nena kadhizanno ne erane» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesuusa eego, «Ta dhanggize duro na7untsana yenggo» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yesuusa lam7intsa, «Yoona na7a Simoona, tana kadhane?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Simoon Phexiroosa, «Yee Laatstso, ta nena kadhizanno ne erane» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesuusa, «Ta duruntsana yeenggo» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yesuusa hyaydzintsa, «Yoona na7a Simoona, tana kadhane?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusa hyaydzintsa Simoon Phexiroosago, «Tana kadhane?» yaga7i oocide gisho Phexiroosa azzanii, «Laatstso, ne ubbabazito erane; ta nena kadhizanno ne erane» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusa, «Ta duruntsana yeenggo. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Ta nees turo turo gaane; ne na7atitsa yeze wode nenes ma77i, ne koyze bessa qitane. Yezin ne cinggide wode ne kushito miccii beessada. Melle asi danccisada; ne kadhoosse bessa kanggoda» yagayda. <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesuusa yinno Phexiroosa akko gaar hyayqo hyayqqii, Xoozza bonchchisad yezako beessades gayda. Yinno gaydannippa suuba, Yesuusa Phexiroosago, «Tana kaallo» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan hyankkay tamaarizan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Phexiroosa suuba maaqqii, Yesuusa kadhize tamaarize faappa suubara ye7izanno bi7ida. Ye tamaarize, kawo muuze bessa Yesuusago shiiqii, «Laatstso, nena aatsii immade oode?» gaydaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:25">Waha. 13:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Phexiroosa ye tamaariza bi7i, «Laatstso, hyay atstse wayade?» yaga7i Yesuusa oocida.<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesuusa eego, «Ta ye7ode wontsis E shemppora yessade gaar ta koyko, nena akko madhe? Ne tana kaallo» yagayda.<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Yinnii gisho, ye tamaarize hyayqqoos gaaze ohe ishuntsana ubba yellida. Yezin Yesuusa, «Ta ye7ode wontsis, E shemppora yessade gaar ta koyko nena akko madhe?» gaydap attin «Hyayqqoos» gaykaaya.<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Hyanna ohiti baz markkidhidayin hyanno xaafide ye tamaarize eza. E markkatitsitan turo maaqqidanno nu erane.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yesuusa oochchide melle gaama baz yene. Ta qoppin, ubba bazi fete fete ommara xaafinttizako, xaafinttize maxaaftis alame gaddodes bessi maaqqada aazoos.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
